  'safari-finding-the-most-endangered-monkey-in-the-world-in-da-nang': {
            averageRating: 4.99,
            totalReviews: 422,
            guideRating: 4.99,
            valueRating: 4.9,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Leonid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "It was an incredible tour with guides Cillian, Leo, and Ngoc. All three were incredibly knowledgeable and friendly, and their eye for the monkeys was unparalleled. We were able to observe the monkeys at four different spots, as they stayed outside longer that day due to rain. Even without the unforgettable experience of seeing these fascinating creatures up close, the trip would have been more than worthwhile for the views of the city and the sea, and the stunning natural scenery. I highly recommend it to any traveler." },
                { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "The guides Leo and Kilian were very good; they did everything to look for the langouren (monkeys). We have seen the langouren on both trips .. were very happy to have them as our guides. We would recomment this trip to everyone who loves these animals and nature." },
                { author: "Frederik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Overall an awesome experience!! Alan was the best guide and we saw the monkeys often because we took some secret routes:) He did some great pictures with his professional camera, which he sent later on! The food afterwards was also very tasty 🥰 You should definitely do this tour if you are interested in rare and local wildlife and wildlifephotography. In Addition he gave me his camera set up and I could try to take some pictures myself! Just an awesome tour with very cool guides. You won’t be disappointed💪" },
                { author: "Arnaud", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Amazing experience, we were able to see many red shanked monkeys and Alan and Hao were great guides, very knowledgeable and friendly. It is a truly private your with a very convenient pick up at your hotel. Alan is a talented photographer and he was kind enough to send us a few of his best pictures." },
                { author: "Blanka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Such a wonderful experience! Both my husband and I enjoyed it so much. We had absolutely no problem seeing the monkeys, we saw many of them, including families and babies. It felt very special because there were hardly any other people around, just a few local photographers and rangers. We were given binoculars and could spend as much time as we wanted watching the monkeys in their natural habitat. It is completely different from seeing animals in a zoo, you feel truly immersed in nature. Our guides were fantastic. Cillian shared interesting facts about the monkeys, while Alan had a profession" },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "We did this tour today and absolutely loved it! Our guides picked us up right on time at 5:30 AM. The motorbike ride was safe and already a great experience, especially riding along the coast at sunrise towards the Son Tra Peninsula. Soon after arriving, we spotted the first rare Red-shanked Douc Langurs. The guides gave us binoculars and explained a lot about the monkeys, their behavior and the surrounding nature. We stopped whenever we wanted or whenever the guides spotted something interesting. Everything was relaxed, well organized and never rushed. One guide also had a professional camera" },
                { author: "Aimi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "We absolutely loved this whole tour! We could walk and feel inside the Vietnamese nature and could observe some insects that are rare to see in my country. Such a precious experience!! Our guide is a true monkey lover with good English skill and general knowledges, calm, and kind which we liked a lot. We changed the original plan into a car as we have a kid and that was a right choice. It is 100% chance to be able to observe the beautiful red-shanked douc monkeys. They are just stunning!!! This tour is highly recommended for those who love hiking, nature in general, and who desire to experienc" },
                { author: "Evgenia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Thank you so much to my guide Leo for this unforgettable experience! Riding through the jungle and following the monkeys truly felt like a real journey into the wild. Everything was perfectly organised according to our schedule, and the whole experience was carried out with great care, enthusiasm, and genuine passion for the job. I truly enjoyed every moment of it and would definitely recommend this experience to anyone looking for a real jungle adventure!" },
                { author: "Robin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "We genuinely enjoyed the sunset tour and saw ca. 4 red-shanked douc families on the tour. Our guide Leo was very good at spotting them in the jungle and spoke English well and told as lot about these monkeys. The binoculars they provide are really helpful and his camera made amazing photos of them." },
                { author: "Marta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "It was such an amazing adventure! Our guides, Leo and Thành, were very professional, knowledgeable and passionate about wildlife. They shared so much interesting information with us and made the whole experience feel really special. We were lucky enough to see several families of monkeys in their natural habitat and capture some truly incredible moments. The guides knew exactly where to look while still being very respectful of the animals and their environment. It was definitely one of the highlights of our time in Vietnam. A unique experience that we will remember for a long time. Highly rec" },
                { author: "elena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "We had an amazing experience! The guides were very friendly, knowledgeable, and well-prepared, and they made the whole experience even more enjoyable. Despite our expectations, we were pleasantly surprised to see so many monkeys, and even get very close to them. It was an unforgettable experience, and we would absolutely recommend it to anyone visiting the area! Thank you Adam and Leo" },
                { author: "Denisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Leo and Alan are the best of the best. They’re so funny, we had an absolute blast. We had a lot of luck catching a lot of of monkeys, but they made the whole trip worth it. They brought snacks, told us a lot of cool facts and Leo took amazing pictures of us along the way. Cannot recommend them enough 🤍 Thank you guys again." }
            ]
        },
