                { author: "Deborah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-16", text: "We had a wonderful time on our private tour with Hiếu. Hiếu was very knowledgeable and we really enjoyed our time with her. The weather at Bana was cold, foggy, and raining but Hiếu still made sure we saw all the highlights and enjoyed our time. The lunch buffet was really good. Marble mountain was beautiful as well. Inside the heaven and hell caves was spectacular. All that natural beauty was stunning. We are very thankful for a wonderful day with Hiếu!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-30", text: "Nous avons payé pour le transport et c’est ce qu’on voulait. Par contre, nous aurions aimé que le chauffeur parle quelques mots d’anglais ou français." },
                { author: "Simone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-31", text: "Autista molto gentile. Per comunicare grazie al traduttore on-line non ci sono stati problemi. Attenzione al meteo quando si va a ba-na. Si trova in cima ad una montagna quindi nuvole basse e freddo se la giornata non é quella giusta." }
