  'chan-may-port-golden-bridge-ba-na-hills-full-day-trip-da-nang': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 8,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-12", text: "Scott was excellent. He communicated clearly before we met, arrived right on time, and quickly confirmed the plan for the day with my husband and I. The weather was poor, and he even offered to bring newly purchased raincoats for us, which was incredibly thoughtful. He was flexible throughout the day, adjusting plans as things evolved, and did an outstanding job accommodating my husband’s and my very different interests. In the afternoon, he even had us on parallel paths for a while so each of us could focus on what we enjoyed most. He knew the sights well, shared helpful context along the way" },
                { author: "Mariella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "We spend an amazing day thanks to our guide The experience and knowledge of our guide was excellent I highly recommend this tour" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "Excelente una guia excelente No estuve explicando cada cosa, tuvo fotografías muy bonitas Si me dicen que calificaciones le pondría sería 10 de 10 El chofer manejó con mucho cuidado y llegamos con tiempo suficiente para tomar nuestro Crucero." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "Our guide Lee was fantastic. My wife and I had a marvellous time. The tour was spectacular with something amazing around every corner. Although it was misty on the way up the mountain, by some miracle the mist cleared and we had a clear view of the Golden Bridge. Awesome day. Thank you Lee for your plentiful knowledge and entertainment during the day." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-05", text: "Our guide Lee was fantastic. He greeted us at the port and took time and trouble to make sure we had a fantastic day. would thoroughly recommend this trip rather than doing trip with cruise ship. Lee asked us what we wanted to do told us lots about the places we visited." }
            ]
        },
