  'tour-trekking-hue-bach-ma-national-park-daily-da-nang': {
            averageRating: 4.81,
            totalReviews: 33,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.75,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-18", text: "Was a very good trip to experience Vietnam and its tropical climate. Due to landslides from previous heavy rains, the day included a few different ways to make the trek. We had a Great morning trek with awesome views and clear skies. We then stopped at one of the lagoons for a swim and some prepared lunch . A cheeky little monkey joined us on most of our journey who was just looking for a free feed from the mountain visitors, but it really added an unforgettable element of the tour. Our guide Sam is full of knowledge about the forest, mountains and the animals on our trek. This made for a very" },
                { author: "Trever", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-05", text: "We booked this last minute and ended up being the only ones so we got our own private tour and had an amazing time. Sam was our guide and I cannot speak highly enough of him. He is super knowledgeable about local flora and fauna and was constantly pointing out different insects and plants we never would have noticed. He is very kind and passionate about nature which made spending the day with him so enjoyable. Even when it started dumping rain in the afternoon it was smiles and laughs." },
                { author: "Natasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-05", text: "The guide and driver were amazing and very helpful the whole day. Lunch was a delicious homemade meal. Highly recommend this tour for those looking for an adventure and some amazing scenery." },
                { author: "Margriet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-12", text: "This tour is definitely recommended! The guide was incredibly friendly. The lunch that was served was extensive and delicious, a delicious Vietnamese meal. Despite the bad weather and continuous rain, the experience was fantastic. It was very nice that Duyen had brought a poncho for us." },
                { author: "Luana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-05-11", text: "Es war schön, durch den Dschungel zu spazieren und unser Guide Han hat uns interessante Sachen erzählt. Gleichzeitig hätte ich mir mehr \"Exercise\" gewünscht, vom Wandern her war es sehr entspannt, mit vielen Pausen. Schlussendlich haben wir nur ca. 4-5 Stunden im Park verbracht, die restliche Zeit auf dem Motorrad und im Auto. Ich hätte es cool gefunden, wenn wir den Wasserfall noch anschauen könnten, dafür frühere Abreise und spätere Ankunft (wir waren schon ca. um 16.30Uhr zurück in Hue)." },
                { author: "Alia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "Es war eine tolle Tour mit herzlichen Guides, Tram und Sam haben viel wissenswertes über die Flora und Fauna vermittelt. Absolut empfehlenswert." },
                { author: "Chloé", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "Excellent moment, je recommande" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-23", text: "Exception thé weather it was a great day" },
                { author: "Leon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-20", text: "Trotz extremen Regen, hatten wir ein tollen Tag im Nationalpark und einen super Guide, der sehr fürsorglich war und uns leckere Lunchpakete zubereitet hat. Er hat uns viel interessantes facts zum park und viel über Natur und Tiere erzählt. Sehr interessant! Und obendrein haben wir noch Affen in den Bäumen gesehen." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-24", text: "The guide (Sam) was amazing!!! Highly recommend, he had incredible knowledge and was a really nice guy to talk to. Bach Ma is really worth visiting, the lakes and the waterfall are just out of this world! The only small thing was the timing - driver came 20 min earlier than he was supposed to." },
                { author: "Filippo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-21", text: "Il percorso è stato interessante, avventuroso e non troppo sfidante. La guida molto disponibile e attenta alle nostre esigenze. La durata dell'escursione è stata giusta con pause frequenti in modo da non stancarci troppo, abbiamo potuto fare il bagno nel lago, gustarci un caffè dal punto panoramico e vedere diversi animali lungo il sentiero. Consigliamo assolutamente!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-02", text: "Was geen al te grote groep, waardoor we niet te lang op iedereen moesten wachten. De gids kende heel veel van de jungle en zijn engels was heel goed. De paadjes in de jungle waren toch wat uitdagend, maar zeer goed te doen. Het zwemmen in de bergrivier was super." }
            ]
        },
