  'local-street-food-walking-tour-in-da-nang': {
            averageRating: 4.82,
            totalReviews: 43,
            guideRating: 4.93,
            valueRating: 4.78,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Very good but too much food. Smaller portions would be great. Mi was amazing!" },
                { author: "Randi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Wasn’t expecting a private tour but it ended up being just my boyfriend and I and Sia our guide. Make sure you don’t eat much this day because it is a lot of food 5 food and 1 drink stop plus a potential bonus. We were so full we skipped one stop and the bonus. We tried two dishes everywhere we stopped. There is some walking in between and that helped us digest some. It was really nice taking to Sia about Vietnamese food and differences between north and south. I learned a lot. I definitely recommend on an empty stomach. My favorite thing I tried was Jasmine tea with salted cream. With definit" },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "This tour was absolutely amazing and more than I could have expected! Word of advice…. Come hungry!" },
                { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "Excellent. We lived our guide and the food. The walk was easy!" },
                { author: "Zoë", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-21", text: "Informative guide (David) with a great sense of humour. We had a fabulous evening with delicious foods, drinks and sights. Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Iain", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-24", text: "Our guide David was excellent. Each stop he took us to was full of locals. The food was delicious. The coffee shop was very quirky. Never imagined drinking egg coffee and peanut coffee but they were both great. Everywhere we stopped we were treated to wonderful local food. Ensure you go on this tour with an empty stomach because theres so many options. Would definitely recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Pete", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "Leo was a fantastic guide she was very knowledgeable and very good English, food was excellent as well, would recommend to do this" },
                { author: "phoebe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-02", text: "We had an incredible time in the local street food tour with our guide Leo. She was super friendly and managed to get us safely across all the roads! The food was yum! 6 different stops, make sure you save some room for the savoury pancakes and bang mi as they are tasty! The only thing was the portion at each stop was a full meal so we ate too much and got full too quickly. The coffee shop was very retro and aesthetic and the only stop with proper air con so we were happy to spend some time there. Highly recommend for families who want to try street food but not sure where to go 😊" },
                { author: "Stuart", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-24", text: "Allie was the greatest. Her knowledge of the food scene was perfect. If you haven't booked this tour you need to." },
                { author: "Steven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-24", text: "our guide was Alley, the most energetic, social and cool person to have taken us on a food tour. My friend and I had the best time. Ten out of ten" },
                { author: "Teresa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-09", text: "Leo has been an amazing tour guide. She has an excellent idea and well rounded information about all the Vietnamese traditional foods and delicacies. Leo is very patient and knowledgeable to all our enquires about the day to day meals of the normal Vietnamese in all parts of the countries. I’m so happy and pleased that we have her as our tour guide for our food trip for today." },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-16", text: "This was a really informative tour, with a wide variety of different authentically local foods.. Each stop, the dishes we tried were completely different. At the end of the night,we came away with confidence to try street foods on our own. Some great tips from Lyn on what to look for when choosing a local foods. Lyn was a wealth of knowledge Vietnamese food and culture and great for a chat! Highly recommend this tour as soon as you arrive in Da Nang, to get the most out of your time here and enjoy the best food!" }
            ]
        },
