                { author: "Martina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-23", text: "On a company trip, we had a free day and so I decided to book a cooking class for myself. The pin location is at a house across from the actual venue, but it was not much issue to be redirected. Jenny was really hospitable, was a great host at her home and kitchen. I was the only booking for the afternoon. She let me know that no matter the enrollee count, she would prepare ingredients for at least two people always. I've only just started cooking in general, but the pacing was great and really felt like prepping food and cooking with a friend :) She let me use up all the ingredients, and so I" },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-21", text: "Had a lovely time learning to make spring rolls, pho and passion fruit juice. The passion fruit juice was made from scratch and was our favourite part. Jenny was a great host and explained the process for all the recipes really well. Thank you for a great morning and great experience!" },
                { author: "Vicki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-09", text: "Very pleasant experience ! Everything was prepared for cooking , food tasted excellent!" },
                { author: "Janine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-24", text: "I really loved this experience! What I liked it that it was at Jenny her home. So it's not the typical tourist activity. She was super friendly and the food was delicious. I can't wait to remake it at home <3 I would 100% recommend this cooking class! Her English is amazing!!" }
