                { author: "Molly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "We had been told to opt for a private tour of BA Na Hills due to the vast size and amount of attractions at the park – we’re very glad we chose this option! Henry was our guide and collected us in the morning along with our driver. He spoke had a lot of knowledge about Da Nang, Hoi An and Ba Na Hills. He answered all our questions and was overall lovely and great to talk to. He asked us what we wanted to do throughout the day but also suggested the order due to queues and busy times etc. We stopped off at the Love Bridge in Da Nang first and purchased a lock. Henry took photos for us and then" }
