                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-25", text: "This activity was so fun and made our trip! The staff and tour guides were amazing. Justin was our tour guide and he was amazing! I would 100% recommend this activity to travelers looking for things to do in Vietnam." },
                { author: "Markus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-04-01", text: "The tour felt quite different from the advertised “small group (max. 14)”. Instead of a fixed group and guide, it was more a mix of building blocks: a bus transfer, a really nice small-group caves and hike experience (we were only 3 people), and then a large boat tour with around 60 people followed by multiple transfers back to Hanoi. Day 1 was enjoyable overall, with a friendly guide and beautiful scenery, but we couldn’t visit Hospital Cave as advertised and would have appreciated more background information about the area. Day 2 felt rushed and less aligned with the description: kayaking wa" },
                { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "C’était parfait, seulement, nous étions les seuls à ne pas aller sur les aux singes à la fin : on a dû prendre une navette depuis le bateau pour rentrer à Hanoi, alors que tous les autres y aller. Ça pourrait être inclus de le tour pour faciliter l’organisation et aussi éviter de la frustration. 😅 Autrement, rien à dire c’était super !" }
