  'lan-ha-and-monkey-island-full-day-boat-trip': {
            averageRating: 4.65,
            totalReviews: 355,
            guideRating: 4.74,
            valueRating: 4.74,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Celecia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-21", text: "Fantastic tour - we especially loved the swimming and kayaking- wonderful guides. Great transportation to and from the boat." },
                { author: "Lena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Great trip, would highly recommend. There weren’t many people on board, the views were simply stunning and we had great time despite the weather. Also shout-out to our guide, besides being really nice he helped me a lot today :))" },
                { author: "Stella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "The whole day was amazing! It wasn’t touristy at all. We were only about 15 people on the boat which was really nice because we had loads of space and a really peaceful atmosphere. Our tour guide Tintin was lovely, he explained a lot to us and made sure to show us the best spots and we had really nice conversations as well with him. All in all the tour was totally worth it :)" },
                { author: "Jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "I had a lovely day. the bay was so beautiful!! must do!" },
                { author: "Artur", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "Our guide was great, spoke perfect English and shared a lot of interesting details with us. The itinerary is also perfect and we got to do everything we hoped to. The lunch was also excellent, one of the best we have had on a tour." },
                { author: "Klervi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "I loved my experience with them. The entire day was super smooth from the pick up to the drop off at my hotel. I had a great day with a lot of fun. The highlight where definitely jumping from the boat and swimming to see monkeys on the beach. Even if the kayak part was also really nice. Ho and, the food on board was delicious !" },
                { author: "sam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-27", text: "A great day cruising around the limestone, visiting beautiful beaches and kayaking. Very good guide and friendly staff, excellent lunch and drinks available to purchase. Pick up and drop off to the pier and a very relaxing atmosphere :) highlight of our trip to the island!" },
                { author: "Lauren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "A very long day but perfect for seeing the bay if short on time or if you prefer to stay based in Hanoi. Our guide, Justin, was excellent. Very professional, friendly and with plenty of information. We had a lovely day on the boat and I particularly enjoyed the kayaking. The small hike on Monkey island was great, but would recommend proper shoes/sandals with straps. The transport felt a little chaotic with several bus/ferry changes each way but it was all very timely and well organised - we just needed a little information from the drivers / the company to avoid confusion." },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Justin, our tour guide was so attentive and was so helpful and knowledgeable. Everything went smoothly and the lunch was very good. Thank you for a great day out." },
                { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "We had an amazing time in Lan Ha Bay, the trip was well organised and the transportation felt smooth. Our guides Justin and Tintin (T) were friendly and very helpful. It includes many activities for a fair price. We recommend it!" },
                { author: "Arlen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "We had an awesome time on this trip! The boat itself was really nice, the scenery was incredible, the activities were really fun/interesting, and the guides were great!" },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "It was a great day overall. I chose the option with transfer from and to Hanoi Old Quarter and it was so convenient. All the activities are really well organised and so they are able to fit a lot of them in so little time. It had been ages since I had so much fun. The guides were enthusiastic and the other staff on the boat were really nice. The food was AMAZING and abundant, you will definitely not be still hungry after. This is the best day trip/guided activity that I've ever had and I'm not exaggerating!" }
            ]
        },
