  'lan-ha-bay-day-boat-with-dark-and-bright-caves': {
            averageRating: 3.82,
            totalReviews: 7,
            guideRating: 3.82,
            valueRating: 3.82,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Eloïse", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-01", text: "We absolutely loved this activity! The scenery is breathtaking, and our guide, Toni, was fantastic – he took the time to explain everything and shared lots of interesting stories. The kayak trip was amazing, the food was delicious (with options for all dietary preferences), and the staff were so kind and welcoming. An experience I highly recommend! 🌿🚣‍♀️" },
                { author: "Jet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-12", text: "It was an amazing tour! Our lovely tourguide billy showed us all the highlights of Cat Ba island in one day. We had some great food, went on a bike trip, kayaking and swimming! And still had some time to relax on the boat and take in the amazing views around the island! If u want to take a tour we can highly recommend this one. Thank u for the amazing day billy and the lovely staff on the boat." },
                { author: "Beatrice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-09", text: "La crociera è bellissima, le camere grandi e pulite ed il cibo molto buono. L'itinerario è davvero ben pensato, ci sono belle attività previste e la visita all'isola di Cat Ba è rara da trovare nelle crociere. Una nota di merito particolare va all''agenzia, Tinny Travel, è stata davvero incredibile: eravamo senza pullman per andare alla crociera e ci hanno trovato un bus all'ultimo minuto, abbiamo cambiato il nostro itinerario e ci ha aiutato con tutti gli spostamenti. Sono stati incredibili sia per la crociera ma anche per tutte le nostre altre richieste. Spero di rivedervi presto :-)" },
                { author: "Erika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-01-03", text: "This was quite a terrible experience. This activity provider charges a 25-35% more than others but gives you a half effort plan. What you will be paying for is food that has tiny portions (e.g. 1 bokchoy per pax, 1 piece of fish pp etc) 1 bottle of water for 2 whole days. Basically given the bare minimum on this “luxury” cruise that states “buffet lunch” on their listing. The bus to take us to and from the cruise was overbooked. Leaving part of our group left STANDING at the doorway during the ride and the rest of us with our baggage on our laps. When we tried to contact the activity provider" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-12-25", text: "The pace was very intense in the programs; everything had to be done quickly. There was very little time for kayaking as well; it had to be finished within half an hour. The service on the ship didn't seem to belong to the luxury category. The food wasn't tasty either! However, the staff was very kind." },
                { author: "Ludger", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-11", text: "Sehr gut organisierte Tour auf einem wunderschönen Schiff in sehr beeindruckender Landschaft. Wir konnten Kajak fahren und im Meer schwimmen. Personal war sehr freundlich und aufmerksam. Nach Tourende sind wir nicht zurück nach Hanoi gefahren sondern wurden auf der Insel Cat Ba abgesetzt, eine tolle Insel. Auf dem Schiff könnte es etwas weniger Aktivitäten geben, aber da es groß genug war, konnte man sich dem auch gut entziehen und die Landschaft genießen." }
            ]
        },
