            totalReviews: 107,
            guideRating: 4.66,
            valueRating: 4.8,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Very good guide ! But we haven’t done ha long bay and monkey island due to the weather :/" },
                { author: "Zuzanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Was a little worried that I made a mistake not booking one of the super fancy huge yachts, but alas I made the right choice. They all went and did the exact same thing, just different looking boats. It was perfect. The guide was informative and spoke excellent english. We were the first ones on the water so we beat the crowds. the food was delicious and there were great vegetarian options. I really enjoyed how the much our guide made sure we didn't pollute or litter. He was great with the monkeys on monkey island, which is not something that can he said of other guides who were trying to make" },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "the pick up was from our hotel, guide was very efficient. He explained everything. We had a boat just for the people on the coach, about 27. The bay is beautiful and stunning. Dived off the boat, swam to beach. Then kayaking, great fun. Lunch on the boat was huge! so much variety. You do have to pay for all drinks, but good variety including beer. Then for a cycle ride to a village (buggy for those not cycling). Another swim to monkey island. NOTE. They donyt advertise it, but there are small boats that will ferry you for 15k each way. Its about 250m swim. Then the boat goes through stilted fi" },
                { author: "Jill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "A brilliant full day out. I can’t recommend it enough, it’s brilliant value for money and all the activities are well managed. The views are beautiful and the boat was spacious and had all the facilities you could want. I’m a vegetarian and I was so well catered for, it truly was a feast. Our guide was helpful and knowledgeable. Go for it!" },
                { author: "Ryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "Very good day trip. a bus come pick you up at your hotel (around 8:30am). Kayak, swimming, bicycle, fish massage and monkey island until 5pm, where the bus come back to your hotel." },
                { author: "Gabi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "Good trip to see everything Cat Ba has to offer. Our driver was amazing. Our guide was good and was happy to answer any questions. We never felt rushed with any of the activities and it was a good length of time to do each of them with time to relax in between on the boat and enjoy the scenery. The value for money was excellent and there was a decent amount of food provided for lunch ☺️" },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "A full day (8 am - 5 pm) filled with activities and time to relax on the boat in between, a huge lunch, snacks, friendly staff, and incredible views. The guides ensure you have a lot of diversity with the activities and things you get to see. Excellent value for the price, would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Aylin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "This Tour was amazing! It had so much to offer and you could do a lot. The Tourguide Ding was also really Kind and helpful. I could Not recommend this Tour enough. I would even do it again :)" },
                { author: "Elena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "it was the best! good communication for the pick up, great trip around places and always enough time in each stop, great food (vegan options too!!) . and gret price as well!!can’t recommend it enough!!" },
                { author: "Molly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Had such a great day out. The day was organized so well. Got to kayak and swim in Lan Ha bay, followed by a delicious lunch. Really enjoyed cycling through Viet hai village! Felt so looked after throughout the day. Would really recommend !" },
                { author: "Karolina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "It was very nice experience. Everything was as described." },
                { author: "Philipp", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Really nice tour with a great and knowledgeable guide!" }
            ]
