  'cat-ba-island-lan-ha-bay-full-day-with-luxury-cruise-ha-long': {
            averageRating: 4.45,
            totalReviews: 192,
            guideRating: 4.66,
            valueRating: 4.51,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Patricija", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Excellent day on the beautiful boat. The food was amazing. Guide was nice and helpful." },
                { author: "Chloe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "My husband and I really enjoyed this tour. Please note that in the summer (we went in May) you don’t get the sunset party on the boat. The lunch was the best lunch we have had on day tours and the other guests were really friendly. The kayaking was fun although we didn’t get to go through the caves, but the landscapes were beautiful. It was great to have such a relaxing day. We would highly recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Lucy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Excellent boat trip with lots of fun activities and a tasty seafood lunch" },
                { author: "Jakub", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "i loved the tour around the ner the Cat Ba island to the Ha Long Bay" },
                { author: "Isabelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "Was amazing, so much fun and felt so luxurious! The food was so nice and such good quality! Everything felt very clean and new and the guides were so friendly and kind! Highly recommend this tour if you want to do lan ha bay" },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Had a very enjoyable trip. I was especially thrilled that our stop was set back from the worst of the tourism. It gave you more space, better views and an authentic feel. Plus, the guide, Minh, was really nice." },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Best day ever. Minh our guide was so friendly and made an effort to speak to all the guests. Such good value for money. A must-do day trip if staying in cat ba" },
                { author: "Simon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-11", text: "Very nice boat tour in Ha Long Bay. The views were amazing. Our guide Minh was especially cool – friendly, relaxed, and fun. The music on the boat was very good and fit the atmosphere perfectly. Minh has a great taste of music. Everything was well organized. I would book again." },
                { author: "Soph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "Really good value for money, cannot complain with a full day boat trip, lunch, kayaking, hotel transfer and the views for £25. Would recommend to anyone staying on Cat Ba Island. guide was informative and told us information about Lan Ha Bay and Ha Long Bay and its history" },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-14", text: "Cat Ba island is stunning, and this tour showcases it beautifully. From start to end the tour is orchestrated seamlessly, all running on time but not feeling rushed. This 8 hour day trip is exceptional value, with cycling, kayaking and swimming all inc., not to mention a fab lunch, we were amazed at what was included. Minh our guide really made the day even more special. This was one of the most memorably beautiful holiday experiences we've ever had! Photos don't begin to do the stunning landscape justice. Highly recommended!!" },
                { author: "Simone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-17", text: "Tour was amazing and all the team on the boat was super welcome, helpful and prepared. Shout out to Minh and his passion for the island was absolutely the highlight of our tour Definitely recommended!!" },
                { author: "Mateusz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-09", text: "I loved every detail of this excursion. it was so well organized and full of attractions. Minh is an amazing guide!" }
            ]
        },
