  'ha-long-bay-1-day-best-value-tour-meals-and-all-activities-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 15,
            guideRating: 4.8,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Oi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "We had a blast. We came as a family of. The price was amazing for what you get. We enjoyed all the activities. The food was ok. My 2 kids enjoyed kayaking the most. Me and my wife enjoyed the power speed boat. The cave was a bit warm inside but it’s not to be missed. We were too old to do hiking but my 2 kids enjoyed it plus swimming in the beach. The whole day was packed with lots of fun activities at an incredible price. We are glad that we came." },
                { author: "Lilianna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "We had a fantastic experience exploring Halong Bay! Our tour guide, Ken, was friendly, knowledgeable, and very professional. He shared interesting information throughout the trip, making the experience even more enjoyable. The cruise was beautiful and luxurious, with delicious food and a relaxing atmosphere. The staff on board were also very friendly and welcoming. We visited Sung Sot Cave, hiked and swam at Titop Island, and enjoyed a peaceful bamboo boat ride through Luon Cave. Everything was well organized, and the scenery was absolutely stunning. Thank you for such a wonderful experience!" },
                { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Amazing day trip to Ha Long Bay! The views were stunning, the cruise was comfortable, and the tour was very well organized. Our guide was friendly and informative. Highly recommend this tour if you’re visiting Vietnam!" },
                { author: "Jiyoung", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Ken was very welcoming and supportive during our tour. He explained different places in detail and taking photos for us. I highly recommend this place to book if you want to experience ha long bay in one day." },
                { author: "Kezia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "Well planned out trip, very long day but Alex our guide was very helpful throughout! The lunch provided was lovely and the activities included were great value for our money! We had beautiful weather, so seeing the bay was wonderful!" },
                { author: "Mohammed", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-19", text: "Excellent. The staff were attentive, lunch was great. We had the entire boat to ourselves. Beautifully quiet bay with no other souls in sight. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Everything was well organized, from the transportation and itinerary to the service on board. The staff were friendly, attentive, and professional, always making sure I was comfortable and enjoying my journey. The food was delicious, and the overall atmosphere was relaxing and enjoyable. Will recommend for my family & friends" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "It was an amazing cruise! We experienced so many wonderful moments-from the well-planned itinerary to the places we visited (it's simply impossible not to fall in love with them), the ship (modern and truly deserving of its 5 stars), the crew, and the level of service! I'd like to give a special shout-out to our guide, Sam. Sam is a true professional! He energized us with his positive attitude. His English is excellent, which made sure we all understood everything during the tour. I’d also like to thank the tour representative, Anna, from the bottom of my heart. She was with us from start to f" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Great experience! The boat was clean, the food was delicious, and the itinerary was perfect. Worth every penny." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "Guide Ken is very professional and enthusiastic Overall the consumption is good value, food is delicious, scenery is beautiful and kayaking is fun I'll think about coming back next time I come to Vietnam." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "Everything was great and followed the schedule. The food was delicious.Tour guide Ken was very friendly, helpful, and funny. I really enjoyed the tour!" },
                { author: "Simona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-27", text: "La attività è stata perfetta, abbiamo prenotato all’ultimo minuti e ci hanno trovato Comunque un posto sulla barca. La guida Alex è stata perfetta e disponibile in tutta la giornata. Consigliatissima" }
            ]
        },
