                { author: "Breann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "loved how nice and informative my guide's were on both days - Mia for the Ninh Binh tour, and Henry for the Ha Long Bay cruise. The views were all beautiful but the Lying Dragon viewpoint was extremely crowded and a bit dangerous to climb up to the very top. The view was amazing, but it would be nice to go somewhere that wasn't so crowded. Otherwise I loved both experiences, and our guides were fantastic!" },
                { author: "Ino", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-01", text: "Had a enjoyable experience and the boat trip was perfect. Would highly recommend this one over a multi day cruise since you're just staying on the water. The guides, Thon & Ricky were also superb" },
                { author: "Pilhoffer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "Jackie was the best, and friendly." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-09", text: "klar es ist sehr touristisch mit einer Masse an Menschen und Booten aber natürlich trotzdem sehenswert und unser Guide war auf jeden Fall super" }
