                { author: "Gemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Va ser una activitat molt complerta, guia (Toni) molt integrador del grup i amb explicacions durant l’activitat que t’ajuden a entendre la cultura. Jornada en grup reduit (menys 20 persones) evitant rutes i masificacions turístiques. Jornada molt variada i completa, va incloure diferents espais de bany (alta mar i en platja) temps kayak i visita poble pescadors. Bon menjar a bord. Tot molt bé, super recomanable😊😊 Final i retorn amb sunset. Molt bona opció si visites Ca Ba" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "The tour was fantastic, and Tony, our guide, was very attentive and ensured we really enjoyed the whole day. His explanations were also very interesting; he knows the area, the tides, and Vietnamese culture inside out, we learned so much. We would highly recommend it without a doubt." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "We had an amazing tour with Cat Ba Ventures! It was such a great way to explore Cat Ba and see Ha Long Bay. With their itinerary we managed to avoid the busy tourist spots — having the freedom to swim without being surrounded by others and arriving at the row boats before the crowds. We saw lots of other cruises arrive as we left and it look chaotic! The views were absolutely stunning, especially as the sun began to set. We even spotted some Cát Bà Langur’s perched on the rocks and called us all over so we could see them. The trip to the fish farm was really interesting! And the food we had fo" }
