                { author: "Victoria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-10-06", text: "One of the worst travel experiences I've ever had. They did not put me on Le Journey Luxury Cruise and instead decided to switch me onto Amanda Luxury Cruise without telling me, and then attempted to call it an upgrade which it absolutely is NOT. All of the food was cold, I got food poisoning, they downgraded my room, the shower nor the bath worked correctly, and they gave me less than 10% refund. I spent the entire journey arguing with them on WhatsApp. the only slightly redeeming feature was a staff member by the name of Vu, but everyone seemed stressed and overworked. SCAMMERS do not book." }
