  'luxury-ha-long-bay-day-trip-5-cruise-and-full-activities-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 7,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Lizeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "The tour was amazing! Minh, our guide, was incredibly kind and always made sure everything was going well so we had a great experience. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Sai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-12", text: "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Hercules Luxury Cruise – Ha Long Bay Our experience with Hercules Luxury Cruise was absolutely wonderful! From the comfortable transfer to the scenic cruise route, everything was perfectly arranged. The team was professional, and Anna, tour Manager and Henry, our guide, was helpful and cheerful throughout. The lunch on board was delicious, and the entire cruise was relaxing and well-paced. Highly recommend this cruise to anyone visiting Ha Long Bay — truly a great way to explore the beauty of Vietnam! 🇻🇳✨" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-09", text: "I joined the Ha Long Bay day trip and had such a great time! The tour was really well organized, the boat was clean, and the staff were super nice and helpful. The lunch on board was delicious with plenty of tasty Vietnamese dishes. Our guide was amazing, he texted me the night before to confirm everything and took great care of us throughout the day. He was funny, informative, and made the trip even more enjoyable. Titov Beach was a bit too crowded, but the view from the top was stunning and totally worth it. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "I truly enjoyed this Ha Long Bay one-day tour. The guide was professional and caring, and the activities were well planned. Titop Island was great for swimming and hiking, Surprise Cave was stunning, and kayaking at Luon Cave was the highlight of the trip. I would 100% recommend this tour to anyone visiting Hanoi." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-19", text: "Ich habe meinem Freund einen Wochenendausflug nach Ha Long geschenkt. Die Fahrt dorthin verlief reibungslos, und auch das Programm war sehr gut organisiert. Das Boot war super sauber und sicher, das Essen hat richtig gut geschmeckt, und das Team an Bord war sehr aufmerksam und freundlich. Besonders positiv ist meinem Freund die herzliche und engagierte Art des Reiseleiters aufgefallen. Wenn ich wieder nach Vietnam komme, möchte ich diese Tour auf jeden Fall noch einmal erleben." }
            ]
        },
