                { author: "Nadia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "Crociera bella oltre ogni aspettativa: cibo ottimo, attivita’ molto carine e ben organizzate. La camera era molto pulita e spaziosa. Lo staff gentile, professionale e disponibile, Charlie, la guida molto carina e simpatica. Ci siamo divertiti tantissimo." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "ottima organizzazione,la guida Tony molto brava e premurosa. personale della barca simpatico e cordiale . gita bellissima la consiglio" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "das Schwimmen & das Kajakfahren & das schwimmende Dorf waren der Hammer! wunderschöne Landschaften" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Un crucero de pocas personas , barco bonito y muy limpio ! El guia muy atento yamable. La comida tambien muy abundante y buena. Muy recomendable para huir de cruceros abarrotados de gente! Ls actividades tambien muy divertidas" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "We really enjoyed our cruise. Everything was well organised and we had plenty of time for each activity. The food was plentiful and tasty. The chefs made a special effort to cater to some of the dietry needs of other passengers. Our guide Tom made a great job of entertaining and caring for everyone. Even though it was action packed we still had time to chill out and enjoy the scenery. I would highly recommend this cruise." }
