  'hanoi-3-day-lan-ha-ha-long-bay-and-ninh-binh-5-star-cruise-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.62,
            totalReviews: 47,
            guideRating: 4.74,
            valueRating: 4.58,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "Cruise was very clean and staff very friendly! Day in Ninh Binh was very well organized" },
                { author: "Louise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "Amazing trip, very well organised, everyone very friendly - loved every minute." },
                { author: "Gabie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "We had the 3D2N tour and it was very very good!! Everything was taken care off. In our opinion, these were two combined tours. Communication from the head office and subsequently the various tour leaders went flawlessly. The Halong Bay tour with La Casta Tours was excellent. Everyone on board tried their best to make you feel comfortable. We were perhaps most impressed by the last day in Nim Bhin and the 3 different places we visited during the tour. Our tour guide Giang (Jason) was the best. He spoke very good English and had a lot to tell. He made the day complete. We really recommend this t" },
                { author: "Jawad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "All activities were amazing, well organised and most importantly fun. Staff also were incredible, went above and beyond to make stay that much more memorable." },
                { author: "Akshay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-27", text: "This tour is a must if you are in Hanoi. Very well organised, with clean, luxurious cruise. All staff were always paying attention to small details . The activities were fun as well ." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Smelly room but staff were very friendly. A bit out of date. Vietnamese food was good but western food lacked flavour. Staff attentive and awesome experience still." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Une excursion tout simplement géniale ! Entre les paysages incroyables de la baie d’Ha Long et la beauté de Ninh Binh, nous en avons pris plein les yeux. Le bateau était magnifique et très luxueux, avec Mike notre guide et un équipage au top : attentionné, disponible et vraiment à l’écoute. Tout était parfaitement organisé pour profiter pleinement de ces quelques jours. Et même coup de cœur pour Ninh Binh, avec ses paysages époustouflants et cette ambiance tellement paisible et notre guide Cuong aka Golden Goat, genial! Une expérience exceptionnelle, de très beaux souvenirs et une équipe aux p" },
                { author: "Yên", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Die Tour mit unserem Tourguide cuong aka golden goat war super. es war eine erlebnisreiche Tour." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-03", text: "The cruise was amazing. The additional drinks etc were crazy prices. The second part of the trip felt unorganised and kind of an afterthought. Still enjoyed it. Maybe not worth the money" },
                { author: "Mandy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "Ricardo hat uns die gesamte Zeit in der Halong Bay intensiv begleitet. Da wir 20min auf den Bus warten mussten, durften wir auf Schiff in eine deutlich bessere Kabine. Auch durch die Casta Cruises Belegschaft und vor allem Candy Nguyen würden wir die ganze Zeit über top betreut. Die Ausflüge und Aktivitäten waren zeitlich top gewählt und nicht zu anstrengend. In Ninh Binh und am dritten Tag in Tam Coc würden wir von einem anderen Guide - Lang - begleitet. Er war sehr gut vorbereitet, sehr ruhig und erfahren und hat den Tag zu einem tollen Erlebnis gemacht. Alles gesamt war dem Preis wirklich a" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-12", text: "Our guides were excellent. Mike aboard the La Casta Star ship was genuinely caring made special efforts to help us celebrate our 25th anniversary. The ship was new and well appointed. The welcome lunch buffet was excellent with many different options. So many great things! Opportunities for improvement: The water in the jacuzzi looked a bit on the green side and I think that is partly we didn’t see anyone use it - us included. Our time on the ship was lovely, but felt really short. To no fault of the ship, July weather was unpredictable, and some activities like kayaking could not be done. The" },
                { author: "Tanguy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-09", text: "Dans l'ensemble, très belle combinaison de croisière sur la baie + découverte de Ninh Bin. La prise en charge en bus pour la croisière était bonne, même si perturbante car pas associée à Entdecke Travel, on voyage avec des personnes qui ne sont pas avec nous pendant l'activité. La dame gérant la salle d'attente de la croisière était froide, ce qui ne ne met pas dans de bonnes conditions pour bien démarrer l'activité. Le guide de la croisière M. Lee ainsi que tout l'équipage de La Costa Cruise étaient au top, aux petits soins et disponibles. Le repas du midi était OK, celui du soir était super" }
            ]
        },
