                { author: "Denny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Tom was a funny guy to have around, lots of jokes und fun facts. The tour was really beautiful." },
                { author: "Daphne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "We had a great time with Captain Thii (Tomas Sparrow!) and his crew. Beautiful scenery and nature. Kayaking and swimming in the quiet beach was one of the highlights. Lan Ha Bay is not as busy as HaLong with smaller boats. We were fed very well and visiting the village was also spectacular! Highly recommend." }
