                { author: "India", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Exactly what I was looking for in a Lan Ha Bay cruise :) Not too crowded, kayaking, cycling, jacuzzi, lunch… it was perfect! Highly recommend for a one day cruise." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-28", text: "Our tour to Cat Ba and Lan Ha bay was excellent! Everything was very well organized and the service was outstanding! Our tour guide Ha was amazing and made sure everything ran smoothly. The tour exceeded my expectations." },
                { author: "linda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Je conseille vivement! Le yacht est vraiment conforme aux photos (transat, jacuzzi, piscine), le lunch buffet est très qualitatif, le guide et l'équipe sont ultra professionnels et très attentifs. On top, le guide a un grand sens de l\"humour et donne des explications historiques et culturelles très claires sur chaque endroit visité. Plein d'activités incluses: kayak, vélo, baignade (les serviettes sont prévues). Très peu de bateaux durant la journée dans la baie, sentiment d'exclusivité, traitement VIP pour un prix très raisonnable 🤗." }
