                { author: "Angel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-25", text: "Really good activities throughout the day. Kin our waitress was very helpful and accommodating. All staff on the cruise were very friendly and had good English. The facilities were very clean and there were showers and towels provided." }
