  'lan-ha-bay-full-day-sunset-cruises': {
            averageRating: 4.69,
            totalReviews: 27,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "Such a relaxing way to spend the evening in Lan Ha Bay. The scenery was stunning, and the sunset created an amazing atmosphere. The staff took great care of everyone, and our guide was enthusiastic and helpful throughout the tour. A wonderful experience from start to finish." },
                { author: "Tracy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "This tour was a great way to experience Lan Ha Bay. The scenery was peaceful, the sunset was beautiful, and the whole trip felt very relaxing. The staff were kind and professional, and our guide was friendly and happy to answer everyone's questions. I'm glad I chose this tour." },
                { author: "Lee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "Best time ever in Lan Ha Bay, view was just exceptional !" },
                { author: "Chilli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "It was perfect from the start till the end. They picked us smoothly from the traffic in Catba town, the sunset was nice and stunning. We had a short time in Catba so we enjoyed this very much. The bay was super clean and exceeded our expectations. Strongly recommended!" },
                { author: "Lan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "it was a great deal ! only negative point to improve the beach stop: the water was really dirty. otherwise activities were great and the guide tour was great. thank you Liu ! ee will recommend it." },
                { author: "Marco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "The tour guide was very funny and informative, he amazed us of his local knowledge. The food was tasty, one of the best experience we had in 2 months in Vietnam!" },
                { author: "Monique", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-19", text: "Lin was the best tour guide ever! He went above and beyond to make this tour amazing. When my daughter couldn’t finish the kayak portion as it was more difficult than we thought, he went above all to help. Really loved our experience in Lan Ha Bay and beaches." },
                { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "Well - organized trip with kayaking and swimming. Wonderful view of Lan Ha Bay! Biking to local village in the park was nice and fun!" },
                { author: "Hiếu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "Me and my wife stucked in a hundreds of options to viisit Lanha bay. Luckily we found this one. Very nice organized from the beginning. Kayaking and biking was wonderful. The local food was tasty. Overall 10/10." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "It was a magical experience in a place where nature is heavenly. We had a wonderful time and loved the bike ride to Viet Hai, a village that is a little bubble of happiness. The crew was lovely and caring. A huge thank you to our guide, Peter, who was naturally kind and attentive." },
                { author: "Brooke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-23", text: "From start to finish, this was such a fantastic experience. Everything was thought of and the booking company were so helpful with transfer arrangements at the end of the tour. Loved everything about this cruise and stay. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Chiara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Abbiamo scelto la crociera al tramonto. La guida era molto gentile e ci ha assistiti nel giro. Bella la baia e la possibilità di fare il bagno e poi di fare kayak in maniera autonoma. Il buffet al tramonto invece era scarso: bevande in dispenser ( non si potevano dare delle lattine?) merendine confezionate e qualche pezzo di frutta. Questa parte da rivedere quindi" }
            ]
        },
