  'ha-long-and-lan-ha-bay-2-day-luxury-cruise': {
            averageRating: 4.4,
            totalReviews: 15,
            guideRating: 4.5,
            valueRating: 3.75,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Léa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-21", text: "Une expérience absolument incroyable, on recommande à 100 % ! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ le logement était d’une qualité exceptionnelle, très propre, le bain avec la vue sur les falaises karstiques restera inoubliable. Tout était parfait du début à la fin. Les activités étaient très bien organisées et variées : le kayak au milieu des paysages magnifiques de la baie d’Halong, le tai chi, et le cours de cuisine resteront un superbe souvenir. La nourriture était excellente à chaque repas, avec un buffet très généreux et beaucoup de choix. On s’est vraiment régalées ! Un immense merci à tout l’équipage, qui a été d’un" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Technically the whole on water experience was under 24 hours with less than two hours of cruising and the rest of the time boat being on anchor. This was disappointing. The crew members were nice and accommodating with specific focus on food, however all their attempts on organising the activities or entertainment were quite amateur and resulted in average enough experience. If I were to do it again, going out on the bay just for the day ( without an overnight stay) would be my choice as both bays are absolutely gorgeous." },
                { author: "Jose", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Extraordinario … todo el crew muy bueno … en especial Winnie, Tom y Pham" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-07", text: "The group was smaller than expected which we really appreciated, food was delicious" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Camera bella e pulita. Attività a bordo rivedibili… La cooking class consiste nell’arrotolare degli involtini e basta, durata 10’ durante l’happy hour. Il thai chi delle 6 del mattino è uno stretching strano che consiste nello stropicciarsi gli occhi e massaggiarsi le ginocchia… durata 10’. Personale gentile e disponibile. Cibo buono, ma poco locale. Bibite e drink molto costosi (7/8 euro un calice di vino, 3 euro un espresso)." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-13", text: "Very nice crew, good is good. Activities could be better" },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-10", text: "Sehr gut! Wenn nicht sogar das Highlight meiner ganzen Vietnamreise. Sehr zu empfehlen! :)" }
            ]
        },
  'halong-bay-lan-ha-bay-kayak-swimming-luxury-day-cruise': {
            averageRating: 4.83,
            totalReviews: 279,
            guideRating: 4.78,
            valueRating: 4.71,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Fodé", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Amazing cruise in the Halong Bay with great activities and above all great crew to host us. Shout out to them and Thomas! The bay is amzing, food was great and activities such as kayak, swimming and the cave were top! I recommend it 150%!" },
                { author: "Lucas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Absolutamente amazing day trip. I totally recommend it. The guide gave us a lot of information. The drive drove safe. And as well a special mention to the waitress Daría. She was so helpful and nice. Great job everyone. I totally recommend it." },
                { author: "Albert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "had a great day out on the water. it was raining but lots of other activities to do. if you have Liam looking after you, you will have a great day. makes some great cocktails! Liam is the best!! We love him :)" },
                { author: "Adrien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Jessica was really a nice guide ! Paradise Cave is amazing" },
                { author: "Yngrid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "This was an amazing tour, well organized, awesome service, including the tour guide and the servers on the boat. Special thanks to Finn, he was super attentive and ensured we were well taken care off all day long. The food was delicious and they kept us well fed through the day. Totally recommended!" },
                { author: "yassin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-03", text: "We had a wonderful experience with Taliya Cruise. Everything was very well organized, from the service to the activities and meals. The entire crew was kind, attentive and professional. Thank you for making our visit to Ha Long Bay truly memorable. We highly recommend Taliya Cruise and hope to come back again in the future." },
                { author: "Phil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "First time on a cruise in Vietnam. Despite the weather it was a great time in Ha Long Bay. The boat is clean and well maintained. The food was decent quality, the prawn spring rolls were my favourite. Daria was our server and did an awesome job." },
                { author: "emilio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Beautiful experience, the guide was incredible and the staff too, we had Finn as waiter and he’s been amazing!" },
                { author: "Mario", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "We highly recommend this trip. The bus picked us up and it was fancy. The boat was gorgeous, the food delicious and the activities were well organised. The perfect day in this stunning part of the world. Our waiter on the catamaran, Liam, was really friendly and helpful. Thanks Liam for keeping us informed all day." },
                { author: "Ertugrul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "It was an amazing experience. So many thanks to Daria she helped us with everything. I hightly recommend this trip" },
                { author: "Marscha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ An unforgettable day from Hanoi to Ha Long Bay! This tour exceeded every expectation! From the moment we left Hanoi, everything was perfectly organized, making the journey comfortable and stress-free. Arriving at the breathtaking Ha Long Bay felt like stepping into a postcard, with its magnificent limestone karsts rising from the emerald-green waters. The cruise was fantastic, the scenery was simply spectacular, and every stop offered something special. Exploring the caves, cruising through the bay, and taking in the incredible views created memories we'll cherish forever. The staff and" },
                { author: "Donna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "A wonderful cruise. Everything was absolutely as expected and the staff were lovely. We were looked after by Finn and our Guide Allan. The boat was lovely and they even supplied beach towels." }
            ]
        },
