  'ha-noi-cat-ba-lan-ha-bay-cruise-viet-hai-cycle-and-kayak-tour-ha-long': {
            averageRating: 4.56,
            totalReviews: 21,
            guideRating: 4.86,
            valueRating: 4.57,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Doris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-08", text: "What a great event! We were picked up at our hotel in Hanoi and had the best time! The bus was comfortable, the bud on the ferry great, delivery to the boat, and the boat experience was perfect! We had the opportunity to swim off the boat that had two slides into the water from the upper deck, kayaked through the islands, snd bicycled through an old village (delivered there by large tuk-tuk, and though we are in our 70's, we are in pretty good shape, and we had a really great time participating in everything. We could not recommend it more." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "Best tour in Vietnam, I seriously wasn’t expecting it to be this amazing, from the boat, the guide, the food, the tour itself! Everything was perfect, amazing guide, off the beaten path tour, I highly recommend! ✨" },
                { author: "Fariheen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "Very well organized and beautiful trip After looking up online for recommended places, most reviewed were about Ha Long Bay which has now become an overcrowded place. One similar experience is at Han La Bay… despite few reviews of the place and the operator, we took the risk to book with them, and thankfully we were not disappointed. The trip started early, at 5am with the driver arriving sharp on time. Since our hotel was located in a small alley, the guide was kind enough to come and pick us at our lobby. We then boarded a limousine van with very comfortable seats, and then headed to Cat Ba" },
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-22", text: "Anh was a great guide, very funny and energetic. He also made a short film of us and sent it to the group after the tour was done that was very professional." },
                { author: "Mareike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Uns hat die Tagestour sehr gut gefallen und wir können sie nur weiterempfehlen. Der Transport von Hanoi hin und zurück war einwandfrei. Als Aktivitäten hatten wir Kajak fahren, schwimmen, Fahrradfahren. Außerdem können wir die Lan Ha Bucht auch sehr empfehlen. Die Bucht war sehr sauber und es war nur zwei andere Schiffe mit uns unterwegs." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Abbiamo optato per lan ha bay in quanto meno turistica di halong bay. (pickup e drop off da Hanoi). posso ritenermi soddisfatto dall'esperienza, rispetta totalmente la descrizione! una nota negativa è sicuramente il mangiare, veramente pessimo e di scarsa qualità. la guida molto gentile e preparata!" },
                { author: "Zoe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-24", text: "Super fun, great tour guide and fantastic day!" },
                { author: "Gomez", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-20", text: "Magnifique excursion ! Je recommande à 100 %. L'organisation était parfaite et les paysages à couper le souffle. Les gens que nous avons rencontrés étaient d'une gentillesse incroyable. Un immense merci à notre guide qui était vraiment au top, il a rendu cette journée encore plus spéciale. N'hésitez pas une seconde !\"" },
                { author: "Silva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-02", text: "Journée magnifique, dommage qu'on a pas pu visiter la grotte." },
                { author: "Kathy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-07", text: "C’est une très belle excursion. Naviguer sur cette baie est une très belle expérience, c’est magnifique. La sortie en kayak et la baignade ne dure pas longtemps mais comme il ne faisait pas très chaud, c’était juste parfait. La visite du village n’était pas spécialement intéressante mais elle permet de faire une sortie sur terre😉 Le guide était sympathique et dynamique." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-28", text: "Bogaty program. Odnowić rowery." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-12", text: "We liked the combination of boat and climbing, and our local guide who climbed up the hill with us was very knowledgeable and friendly, and explained a lot to us about nature and the island. The hill is really steep and it is more climbing than hiking, the view from above is stunning. The food we got in the village was excellent." }
            ]
        },
