                { author: "Wendy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "This was a wonderful day trip from Hanoi. We saw some beautiful sites, there was lots of food for lunch, the guide was excellent. we strongly recommend this adventure." },
                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "It was fun and at the same time relaxing experience. Cruising along the bay with a nice scenery. The food on board was delicious and the car/boat driver, tour guide and boat staff were all friendly and helpful." },
                { author: "Wanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-04", text: "Everything was good Timing was perfect Your guide was good Drive was nice and safe Beautiful bay" },
                { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-02-25", text: "Excellent trip, shame about the weather, but can't blame anyone for that." },
                { author: "Rafal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "Great organization, experience and weather :)" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-04-05", text: "I booked what was advertised as a private Halong Bay tour. Pickup was in a very nice 4x4, which felt premium, but the boat was actually a large 48-person cruise boat and it was just me and my girlfriend on it alone. I expected a smaller, more premium private boat for the price. Instead, it was a standard group tour boat without the group. The tour itself was very good, and the guide and staff were excellent and very informative. Food was amazing. We did kayaking and visited the caves, which were great experiences. However, the tour was only about four hours and cost over £300, when a similar t" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-25", text: "war alles super gab nichts zu bemängeln" }
