                { author: "Stella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "Excellent tour. Well worth the 2 hour trip from Hanoi and very good value for money compared to others I’ve seen. Our guide, Bang, was friendly, knowledgable and informative and always on hand throughout the trip. The transport bus was large and comfortable. The only thing we didn’t like was the rest stops on route to and from Halong Bay - it’s always a sales pitch, you can’t just stop for a coffee and to use the restrooms without being lured into a craft village or bamboo factory to buy stuff. But I think that’s just the way it is there. The ship itself was a good size, comfortable and well e" }
