                { author: "Mariska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-05", text: "Het was een perfect geregelde activiteit! Het hele schema klopte, niks duurde te lang en het eten was heerlijk! Mooie hut voorzien van allerlei leuke gadgets! De cruise manager was heel aardig en aanwezig wanneer het nodig was. De omgeving was adembenemend!! Kortom, doen" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2023-11-22", text: "The cruise part was nice, if a bit run-down. No big complaints there. The Ninh Binh tour was terrible. First they bring you to a scam “workshop” for disabled people, where they display a disabled man and ask for donations, alongside selling fake designer bags (and they omit this from the itinerary of course). Then they bring you to a fake pagoda, which was built in recent years for foreigners to visit only. It’s completely boring and has no historical value. Then they take you to a barely edible buffet lunch full of other tours. After all this, they finally let you see the nature you came all" }
