  'landmark-81-skyview-and-dinner-cruise-in-ha-long': {
            averageRating: 4.06,
            totalReviews: 6,
            guideRating: 4.06,
            valueRating: 4.06,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Ho", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "I booked this experience for a few colleagues who were visiting from the UK, and we all had a great time. They really enjoyed the stunning view from Landmark 81, and the dinner cruise was a lovely way to end the evening. Definitely worth it if you’re looking for something special to do in the city. I’d happily book it again!" },
                { author: "Huynh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Had such a great evening! I booked this experience because my cousin was visiting from the US, and I wanted to show her a different side of Ho Chi Minh City. The SkyView at Landmark 81 was amazing—we arrived just before sunset, so we got to see the city during the day and then all the lights come on at night. The view was absolutely worth it! The dinner cruise was also a really nice experience. The atmosphere was relaxing, the food was good, and it was so nice just sitting by the river, enjoying the night view and chatting together. The staff were friendly and everything was well organized, so" },
                { author: "Thi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "We had a wonderful experience on this tour with our family. The combination of visiting Landmark 81 SkyView and enjoying the dinner cruise was a great way to spend the evening in Ho Chi Minh City. The views from the observation deck were breathtaking, especially at sunset, and the cruise offered a relaxing atmosphere with beautiful city lights along the river. The food was good, the staff were friendly and attentive, and everything was well organized. It was a memorable experience for our family, and we would definitely recommend this tour to anyone visiting the city." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "I had so much fun and lily was a wonderful tour guide- the dinner cruise was amazing" },
                { author: "Priscilla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-08-03", text: "WAARDELOOS STOREND EN ONDUIDELIJKE INFORMATIE TIJDENS DE BOEKING STAAT ER WAT JE KRIJGT MAAR NIETS IS WAAR. ALLEEN GELDKLOPPERIJ!" },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-06-11", text: "The trip to the 75th floor of Landmark 81 was amazing. However the journey to the dinner cruise took quite a while due to traffic, but also the driver seemed to be in no hurry either. The tour guide said there was usually traffic, but surely the driver would keep track of it, and update us with a leaving time from Landmark 81. We made it to the boat by 5 minutes before it left. By this time everyone else had already eaten and went upstairs to watch the departure, while we could start our meal. We had the buffet, which was average, strongly seafood. The city lights from the boat were very nice." }
            ]
        },
