                { author: "Rodney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-29", text: "Our guide and cycle drivers were fantastic cruise was great" },
                { author: "Christie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-07", text: "We loved the cruise and our tour guide Wisky was great, very informative and friendly. Wisky took photos for us and made sure we had everything we needed. The buffet was very nice, lots of choice and a great way to be able to try a little bit of everything. The entertainment onboard the ship was also good. Would recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Scott", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-07", text: "Very good. Bike pick up was fun, guide was attentive and interesting. The food selection was better than we expected, the boat was very clean and the boat staff worked hard and were desperate to help in any way they could. Our guide, Kent was cheerful, informative and spoke great English. Overall, a fun, relaxing evening." },
                { author: "Tammy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-15", text: "We had the most amazing time with Tri from Saigon Adventure. We could tell from the first hello that he was going to make this a great night. My group of 7 people are aged from 8 - 70 and we all enjoyed our cyclo tour. This was 45 mins through the city and even being on the road amongst the chaos we felt safe and looked after. After the cyclo we boarded our boat and enjoyed some delicious buffet food. After dinner Tri took some great photos and my 8 year old son and him talked for ages. We felt he generally cared and was listening to him. My son can talk a lot and he didn’t care! I highly reco" },
                { author: "Bita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-25", text: "This tour was absolutely amazing from start to finish! Francis, Man, and Dragon (Van and Do pick) picked us up and took us on an exciting motorcycle ride through town — such a fun and unique way to see the city! Riding on the bikes gave the whole experience an extra thrill, and we loved every minute of it. After the ride, we were taken to a dinner cruise, and the buffet on board was delicious! Great variety, fresh flavors, and plenty to enjoy. The whole evening was well-organized, exciting, and full of great food and sights. Highly recommend this tour if you're looking for a fun, memorable exp" },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-22", text: "This was a great experience from start to finish, our host Canon was great and could not have done more to make us comfortable. Would recommend this trip to any other first timers of HCMC." },
                { author: "Kim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-16", text: "Brilliant and value for money. No improvements required." },
                { author: "Patrick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-13", text: "All is perfect Our guide very efficient and cool The cyclo night tour very well And the buffet very good Many thanks for all" },
                { author: "Dean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-23", text: "We started off with the Cyclo tour which was amazing! Our tour guide DOM was exceptional in facilitating our experiences. He spoke English very well and even though we had a group of 7 people, he always made sure we were taken care of and helped with any questions or concerns. The food buffet had a good range of options and the live music on board the Indochina Queen was unforgettable! If you decide to book this tour and you get Dom as your tour guide, you will not be disappointed.. he is the man! 😍 Thank you 🙏🏽" },
                { author: "Brooke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-18", text: "Our activity was awesome! The tour guide was great and the scooter ride was good too. Was definitely worth it." },
                { author: "Kristina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-25", text: "We loved the pick up by the city bikes. The arrangement was lovely." },
                { author: "Alastair", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-01", text: "Richard was our guide and excellent. The 2 elderly gentlemen who cycled were amazing through the chaos of Saigon traffic. The boat was modern and the staff were so attentive. There was a wide range of food that should satisfy everybody’s tastes. The freshly cooked prawns were especially good. The boat then sailed along the river to the port and back again. We stood on the topdeck admiring the skyline of Saigon - so memorable. We recommend this tour." }
