            reviews: [
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-11", text: "This was great fun, the driver was fantastic the guide on the boat spoke no English (but why would he we are in Vietnam) despite this he was great fun and it was a great experience with a little odd visit to a water karaoke 😂" },
                { author: "Linda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-28", text: "It was one of the highlights of our 3 week Vietnam holiday - so much fun and the perfect amount of time" },
                { author: "Tomos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-28", text: "We had a great time at the coconut forest. Transport was easy and quick, and our guides were so fun and friendly! The ride was peaceful and funny at the same time. Would highly recommend!!!" },
                { author: "Stuart", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-24", text: "Great wee morning adventure. Guide / oarsmen didn't speak any English but we enjoyed breaking through the language barrier with him." },
                { author: "EMMA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-10", text: "We had such a great time with our local guide. We were lucky enough to have a private boat ride as no one else was in our booking. It was a beautiful sight and our guide whilst he didn’t speak much English was so helpful in picking photo opportunities. He recorded our spinning boat and even showed us quieter sections with coconut flours" },
                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-18", text: "I loved the vibe which was totally unexpected and my guide was fun to be with." },
                { author: "Tori", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-10", text: "Was a great atmosphere and everyone was very kind. The weather unfortunately was not good if it had been I think we would have enjoyed it much more." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "It was a very good experience. They were on time to pick us up and very friendly people. Highly recommend it." },
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-16", text: "Quick & enjoyable, didn’t consume a whole day." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-11-03", text: "特になし 迎え時間も15分くらいはやくきてもらってスムーズに乗り込むことができました。" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-09-08", text: "The boat ride and experience were as advertised and good value for money. However, if your expectations are for a quiet boat ride along the serene coconut canals, you’ll soon be confronted with photo ops, loudspeakers playing “Gangnam Style”, and karaoke boats. We left feeling like it was all a bit random and no longer an authentic experience." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-08-23", text: "Really amazing experience. Had to pay extra for the boat spinning, and my guide struggled to take photos on my phone, so we felt quite trapped with the professional photographer to buy the photos he took. However, an amazing location, really good fun with the boat spinning and so much fun to be in the coconut boat. Would recommend going early as got very busy!" }
            ]
