                { author: "Lucia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Our one-day tour to Mỹ Sơn Sanctuary, Marble Mountains, and Lady Buddha was the best part of our trip. Our driver and guide, Lam, was amazing. He was very friendly, helpful, and knew a lot about the history of each place. He drove safely and made us feel very comfortable by providing fresh cold water and free snacks throughout the day. We loved exploring the ancient temples at Mỹ Sơn, climbing the beautiful caves at Marble Mountains, and seeing the giant Lady Buddha statue by the ocean. Everything was perfect and well-planned. We highly recommend booking a tour with Lam if you visit Da Nang or" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Lam was a very educated guide. I have learned so much about Vietnam, its cultue and history. I can definitivly recommend booking a tour with Lam." },
                { author: "Matteo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Mr. Trung è stato fantastico, gentile e disponibile. Ci ha dato tante informazioni sulla città e sui posti in cui dovevamo andare dandoci anche qualche chicca in più. l'esperienza è stata molto positiva su tutto, i posti i luoghi e le tempistiche rispettate. Consiglio a tutti questo private tour." }
