                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-24", text: "A great day! Our tour guide Michael and Mr. Long our driver were the best people we could ask for on this trip. Michael brought great attitude, energy and atmosphere throughout the day during the tour. He helped take pictures, always checked in on us and always communicated timings and what we would do next. Mr. Long our driver drove us safely to each destination and offered water. It made the tour so much better having these two!" }
