                { author: "Johann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Lili was an excellent guide and the food was delicious." },
                { author: "Dawna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "We booked this experience because we were unsure of what to eat in the area, Lilly was a great guide and gave us lots of information on Vietnam, more than just the food, the food was great and everything we tried was delicious, if your coming to Hoi an and want a sample of some dishes book this tour" },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Lily was an amazing guide :) thank you for sharing your culture and knowledge with us!" },
                { author: "Debra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Tour with Lily was an absolute gem of a tour! Lily is very knowledgeable about the food and took extra time to explain how it should be eaten…… Lily is extremely personable and a genuinely lovely person!!! I would highly recommend this tour! Bring your appetite as there is a lot of food!!! Enjoy! ❤️🙏🏻🇻🇳🇨🇦" },
                { author: "Tara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Lily did a great job job guiding us around Hoi An‘s food scene. She spoke very good English and we were able to understand her easily. All the food was excellent and we were so stuffed at the end. We ended up going back to a few of the restaurants later on our trip. It was a worthwhile evening and a great way to explore Hoi An through its food. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Jacquie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "our guide was amazing. she took us to lots of cool places and talked about the history of Vietnam which I really enjoyed. lots of hidden gems." },
                { author: "Kerri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "We had a fantastic night on our food tour - amazing food. Lily was such a great host and we thoroughly enjoyed visiting local spots that we certainly wouldn’t have found by ourselves. Our group was also very small which made the experience so much nicer and we were able to share stories with each other while also learning about some Vietnamese and Hoi An history. I would highly recommend this tour - and come hungry!" },
                { author: "Paulina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "The food tour was amazing! We had a great time and the food was delicious. There was so much so come hungry! Great experience to try local food with an awesome tour guide. Thank you for showing us Hoi An!" },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Lily our guide was very knowledgeable. Really pleased to experience the Bahn Mi from Phuong Bahn Mi shop. Best we have had in Vietnam. Thanks Lily. We were so full at the end of the tour" },
                { author: "Suzannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Lily, put guide was excellent. Everything appeared to be planned out well and the pace of the tour was perfect for us. Interesting food choices and Lily explained everything clearly. A really enjoyable evening in Hoi An. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Francesco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "The activity deserves it for two great reasons: Lily's friendliness and availability as well as the goodness and variety of the dishes tried. Lily helps you discover hidden but excellent places that, without a local and trained guide, you would never know. The opportunity to talk to a local person capable of telling his country beyond appearances and stereotypes is also nice. Thank you, Lily! Super recommended experience!" }
