                { author: "Vera", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "I had a great experience on the snorkeling tour to the Cham Islands, even though the weather wasn’t the best. Dao was an exceptional guide: very friendly, helpful, and with excellent English. She really made the experience enjoyable despite the bad weather. The snorkeling was still really nice, and we were able to see corals, different kinds of fish, and beautiful blue starfish. The lunch was also excellent. Overall, I really enjoyed the tour and would highly recommend it, especially thanks to Dao!" }
