  'easy-rider-motorbike-tour-via-hai-van-pass-hoi-an-da-nang-hue-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.99,
            totalReviews: 1078,
            guideRating: 4.99,
            valueRating: 4.94,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Stephanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "We had an exceptional time on this tour, all thanks to Hai vs truyen!! He was very knowledgable and took us to some great spots. The bike ride was smooth and comfortable. Would strongly recommend doing this tour. Thanks again Hai!!!" },
                { author: "Quinten", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "It was amazing! Tour guide Hai showed my beautiful places and told me many stories. Really enjoyed the tour, I definitely recommend going." },
                { author: "Omar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "everything was great our tour Guide viet and long are awesome highly recommend" },
                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "This was one of our best activities in Vietnam so far. The guides were great, they drove very responsibly and had all gear (helmets, raincoats etc.) ready for us. Bikes were nice and comfortable to sit on, even for taller people (190cm and 170cm). Also appreciated that they were exactly on time to pick us up, showed great non-tourist spots along the ride, and paid for coffee, tickets along the way. Would definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Sue", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "My day motorcycle trip with Viet, the driver, was extraordinarily wonderful. He looked after me very well & catered for everything to make my experience the best it could be. Viet is a natural at reading people, even those with no motorcycle knowledge like myself, & working with it to provide a safe & rich experience." },
                { author: "Holly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "4 friends and I had the most incredible day trip with Vin and the team exploring the Hai Van pass, incredible waterfalls, the lady Buddha and a remote beach restaurant. We all agreed it was an absolute highlight of the trip with unreal scenes. Super comfortable bikes made for such an incredible way to view so much of an area we woudnt otherwise explore. An absolute must do activity if you’re staying in Hoi an or da nang" },
                { author: "Mike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Had an awesome day touring! We had periodic stops throughout the day that broke up the full day well. Our guides, Viet and Long, were knowledgeable, friendly, and flexible with timing and itinerary. We were nervous at first but they drove well and we had a blast doing so! Would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Lydia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Wow! I really can’t say enough wonderful things about this experience. My easy rider Quynh was amazing. He was so friendly, accommodating, and an excellent driver. I loved that I really set the pace of the tour, spending more time at activities I was most interested in. I felt totally safe, the bike was really comfortable, I got great photos, and Quynh was always checking in with me and making sure I was having a good time! This activity was absolutely a highlight of my time in Vietnam and I’d recommend it to anyone and everyone!" },
                { author: "Libby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "I had a great time with An, he was a fantastic guide, telling me the history of Vietnam when we stopped in various places. He was already ready to answer any questions I had. The ride itself was so safe and the bike was very comfortable. It was a fun way to get to Hoi A from Hue!" },
                { author: "Taryn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Viet and Son were the best guides! Super knowledgeable and made sure that we were okay throughout the trip. We took multiple breaks during the trip at view points for pictures. Great value for money, I’d definitely recommend it to anyone who’s in the area! A long day but so rewarding!" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Highly recommended! The tour is so beautiful and I have seen temples, waterfalls, the dragon bridge, hai van pass and beautiful beaches in one day. My guide Quynh was amazing! I felt very safe and comfy on the bike and he also gave me a lot information about history, country, temples and people in Vietnam. Cảm ơn!" },
                { author: "Alissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Công was my guide! He was really funny, spoke very good English and explained to me a lot of things about history and general facts of the city! Very nice guide! Showed me local spots and took pictures of me too! 100% recommend" }
            ]
        },
