                { author: "Breanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Great fun, guide sing most of the time. Didn’t speak much English so didn’t give us much info but that’s okay as we still had a great time" },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "This was such a fun activity. So well organised. Yes it’s touristy, but it’s genuine fun and great for photo opportunities. We had a really good time. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "Couldn’t recommend more, definitely value for money! Once I arrived at the meeting point, I had the opportunity to get a drink before being driven down the road to a beautiful lantern making studio. The instructor was very skilled and patient, and his lovely disposition made it really enjoyable. The coconut boats were similarly enjoyable, with a beautiful route through the coconut village and opportunities for spinning and karaoke if you would like to do it. There’s also a crab fishing part, however as a vegetarian I wanted to skip this and they were very accommodating." },
                { author: "Miriam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "We had a great time. Our boat driver was a lot of fun, smiling and singing the whole way through" },
                { author: "Hana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Very good tour with a great atmosphere and vibe!! Amazing guides and truly a unique only in vietnam experience!! Highly recommend!!" },
                { author: "Yu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Hanh he’s good tour guide and good photographer! Also he’s a good entertainer! Thank you!" },
                { author: "Euneece", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "my guide kept me entertained the entire boat ride!" }
