                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-23", text: "Perfect way to get from Hoi An to Hue over the Hai Van Pass with its amazing views. A stop at the top for coffee and some pics. The lagoon is very pretty and the beach was spectatular! Our driver was lovely, we opted to not stop at Marble Mountain as we wanted more time in Hue. Nice SUV and good driver!" }
