            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Isobel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-03", text: "Such a great day! Mr Linh was our guide and he was a wealth of knowledge and so much fun! Skipped the coconut boat queue and got such amazing photos taken by Mr Linh at every stop! Great way to spend the day from Hoi An." },
                { author: "Trond", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Nice with private boat and skip ques, waiting and snorkling in big groups. Got much more time to our selves. Nice beach at Cham Island. Fun with the coconut forest. Be aware that they will charge you extra if you do the spinning in the coconut boat. They asked us to tip the boat driver as well, which we didn’t do because of the price we already paid. Guide with lots of knowledge of history and information" },
                { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "On a choisi ce tour privé pour gagner en tranquillité et flexibilité et c’est exactement ce que nous avons eu. Mr Linh s’est très bien occupé de nous du début à la fin. Nous avons fait du snorkeling dans un seul endroit sans sentir la pression du timing. Beaucoup de poissons et un local nous a escorté le long des coraux. Sécurité maximale. Matériel tout à fait correct." }
            ]
