  'hoi-an-food-tour-backstreets-market-walk-and-12-tastings-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.95,
            totalReviews: 55,
            guideRating: 4.95,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Tamara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Quin was a very informational tour guide, we really enjoyed the tour and food!" },
                { author: "Qatr-Al-Nada", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Incredible experience!!! We tried numerous dishes at many hidden gems. I would highly recommend. Cuong was very kind and knowledgeable ❤️" },
                { author: "Remy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Absolutely amazing night. Our guide Q took us to several \"restaurants\" we never would have visited by ourselves, but the food was out of this world. A day after we even went back to one of the spots to eat there again. Great portions too, not just quick bites. Would recommend to everybody visiting Hoi An." },
                { author: "Gemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "amazing food tour, guide quin was the best tour guide!!!" },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Wonderful evening exploring Hoi An's unique and delicious culinary scene. Quin was a friendly and knowledgeable foodie who chose a great selection of restaurants and dishes for us to try. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Lewis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Leo was such a fantastic guide very informative and went above and beyond to ensure we had a great evening" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Such an amazing experience! More food than I could eat and a fabulous way to explore the back streets of Hoi An. You could tell that Sam was just as passionate about educating his patrons about the various cultural aspects related to the tasting experience and well as promoting local business and their families. Can’t recommend this enough, it was awesome. Thank you! X" },
                { author: "Tom", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Quin was a very friendly local foodie and a knowledgeable guide, who took us to some great restaurants that I never would have come across. She knew so much history of both the food and the restaurants, which made for an immersive, educational and most importantly, delicious tour!" },
                { author: "Emile", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "This one is definitely recommended! Our tourguide Sonny was very nice and friendly. He could tell a lot about the local food and other interesting facts about Vietnamese culture. We went to 8 different local places and tastes 12 different dishes. We’re very full at the end, so it’s definitely worth the money." },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "This was a fantastic tour hosted by our guide Man. Man adeptly navigated our party of 3s very specific and varied food requirements. He took us to some amazing food options off the tourist track. Man was knowledgeable and passionate about both the food and his city. I would highly recommend this tour. Michael Australia" },
                { author: "Kathryn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Wow! We walked down many backstreets and sampled various street foods, small restaurant specialities and even foods prepared in people’s homes. We tried things we would likely not have on our own and at places we may not have ventured into. Our guide, Man, was knowledgeable about food, the area and history. We also had To along on the tour, learning the ropes of tour guiding. He was also friendly and easy to talk with. About 3km walk but broken up between 7 locations so doesn’t seem far." },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "such an incredible tour ! quin is so knowledgeable about hoi an history and culture, and took us to places we would have never found otherwise ! we were so full at the end !" }
            ]
        },
