                { author: "Misty", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "If you’re looking to do something different and fun, do this cocktail experience with Tim! Not only were the cocktails really good, we enjoyed spending the night together learning more about the history of Vietnam." },
                { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "Loan was a fabulous host for our cocktail evening - she was so friendly and entertaining, she had lots of local knowledge and showed us bars we would have found . We where lucky to have a small group of three ourselves and a lovely American lady called deb and we laughed and chatted the whole evening .. highly recommend x x x" },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "We thoroughly enjoyed this cocktail tour, and highly to recommend as an experience in Hoi An, exploring hidden gems in the Old Town. Loan was an amazing host, and we had a fantastic group to enjoy the night with! A highlight of our holiday in Hoi An." },
                { author: "Laurie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "We had a great time during our cocktail experience. Went to places we would never have found by ourselves. Group was fun as well. Definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Reginald", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-04", text: "We enjoyed this tour, they were amazing cocktails and good off the beaten track venues. Ky was an amazing guide." },
                { author: "Johan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-29", text: "The evening turned out absolutely fantastic, thanks to Tihm, our guide, who was like a living encyclopedia, and our lovely new cocktail friends. Tihm made everyone feel included and showed us places we would never have found on our own. Thank you for one of the most enjoyable evenings of our entire trip. We can highly recommend the tour." }
