  'marble-and-monkey-mountains-with-am-phu-cave-in-hoi-an': {
            averageRating: 4.74,
            totalReviews: 254,
            guideRating: 4.78,
            valueRating: 4.71,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Nhu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-05", text: "I loved it! the views were amazing. I enjoyed the caves, mountains and temples. I wish I could nap in a cave. Our guide, Lee, was a very nice man. I felt like I had a personal guide sometimes despite it being a group. Thank you, Lee! Would totally recommend this to anyone. Mountain views are gorgeous." },
                { author: "Stine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Lovely trip with beautiful stops. Great tour guide (Mike)" },
                { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Fabulous day, guide Misa very knowledgeable & friendly. Driver Huo was safe and vehicle was comfortable. Lunch was delicious & catered for vegan/vegetarians. Am Phu Cave interesting and learnt a lot about Buddhism “after life” and the 18 levels of Hell. The 400 steps up Marble Mountain were done in stages, the most around 100 steps at one time, there is a lift not sure if it drops you off at the stages as you go up or just takes you to the top, as I walked. Lady Buddha was beautiful but saw no monkeys today." },
                { author: "Gary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-25", text: "Lia was an excellent guide and explained things very well" },
                { author: "Line", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "Wonderful day with our guide Mike! The tour itself was only 4 hours, plus transportation and picking everyone up. Mike is very knowledgeable and gave us a lot of insight into Vietnamese culture and Buddhism. We were happy with the flow and pacing, but this is very group-dependent I think. Everyone in our group were relatively young and on the same wavelength, so it was an easy-going trip." },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-12", text: "Had a fabulous 4 hrs, lots to see and beautiful views but felt very rushed only getting 5-10 mins at each point. I’d have rather not had lunch and stayed longer at each place or the tour needs extending in length. That said everything else was fantastic and well worth visiting!!!!" },
                { author: "Heather", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-18", text: "Great tour and lunch was amazing. Highly recommend." },
                { author: "Sue", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-23", text: "Trip was well organised and flowed easy. Great sites with historic details. Loved the views and the monkeys 🐒 🙈" },
                { author: "Gemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "A great day. Too hot for monkeys, sadly, but Quyên was a lovely guide and it was fascinating to learn about history, culture and religion in a beautiful place." },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-01", text: "Loved this tour—such a good mix of exploring, stories, views, and honestly… the food alone was worth it. Marble Mountain was stunning, like wandering through a hidden temple world with caves, carvings, and surprise views around every corner. So much to see but it never felt rushed. Lunch with a local family was so good. Proper home-style Vietnamese food, full of flavour and made with care—you could really taste it. Am Phu Cave was unexpected in the best way. A bit eerie, super fascinating, and actually kind of moving. Then Monkey Mountain gave us sweeping views over Da Nang and a peaceful mome" },
                { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-24", text: "We had a great tour, and our guide was lovely and very helpful. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Calida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-10", text: "The day trip was well planned and thought out. Our guide was super informative, helpful and communicative as well. Will recommend!" }
            ]
        },
