                { author: "Phylis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Terence was an exceptional guide who made our trip unforgettable! I highly recommend him to anyone seeking a knowledgeable and accommodating tour guide. I was traveling with my three older sisters, who are prone to fatigue and have difficulty walking. Terence was incredibly understanding and promptly suggested taking breaks between restaurants. He even went the extra mile by hiring an electric taxi to ensure that we all had a comfortable and convenient ride. We sampled 8 local dishes and ended the meal with a cold refreshing ice tea from MOT. He also guided us in releasing our lanterns into th" },
                { author: "kemoya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "My tour guide Cuong was amazing , he was so friendly, patient and polite. He took me around and explained everything in detail." },
                { author: "Tanja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "Highly recommend this tour- great food and great local stories. For the best of local Vietnamese food in alleyways you would never find, at places the local Vietnamese eat. A unique experience and insight to local knowledge and stories that you don’t want to miss. highly recommended." },
                { author: "Fiona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-07", text: "It was amazing Tommy was a great guide and very knowledgeable" },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-02", text: "It was such a good way of trying different local foods and having someone to guide you to the best spots was great! The food was delicious and our guide Terrence was great too he was funny and very helpful" },
                { author: "Amit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "Terence is a wonderful guide and we were lucky to have him. Had some wonderful food in places that we would never have gone on our own and learned the history Absolutely value for money" },
                { author: "Leen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "Amazing tour with Terrance, the best guide ever! He takes you to all the hidden gems, to eat where locals eat, and makes it an unforgettable experience. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Evita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-02", text: "My guide, Cuong, and his wonderful tour was my highlight of Hoi An! Interesting dishes with interesting stories behind them. My guide even helped me with a request outside of the tour itinerary, which I was very grateful for. He also takes the best photos and videos! Lots of wonderful little surprises throughout the tour. Don't miss this tour while in Hoi An, it will enrich your trip! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐" },
                { author: "Timothy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Terrence is my king of Hoi An, absolute legend with great knowledge of all the best food spots as well as some history of Hoi An. Made us feel like a local and gave us a night we won’t forget!" },
                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-08", text: "We had a fantastic time with Andy, our guide. He really made the tour great, speaks very good English and gave us information about Hoi An along with some great food. We had a really fun night, he kept us laughing and we thoroughly enjoyed ourselves. Andy is the best!" },
                { author: "Maayan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "Thien (Terrence) is a wonderful guide that won't let you finish the tour until your stomach is full! I had the pleasure of touring with him over many stops and enjoy such delicious foods while listening to the history and origins of each dish. The best food tour I had in Vietnam so far and that's not easy to say! Don't hesitate, hurry to book this tour!" },
                { author: "Dragan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-25", text: "Guide was the best! Many useful info, authentic dinners. He even sent me an extra magnet directly to my hotel!" }
