                { author: "Sangeeta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Vy is an excellent guide. He shared so much information on the various types of food and the families and people behind the food. We highly recommend doing this tour!" },
                { author: "Gabby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Wonderful experience, great way to see the city and try traditional Hoi An food. Troung was awesome. Would recommend" },
                { author: "Shreya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Thank you so much Ms Viet for lovely tour and delicious food, we had an amazing time! Highly recommend!!" },
                { author: "Lori", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Nhuoc was an amazing guide! Our first stop was a block from the hotel we had been staying in for a week and would have never found it. Every stop had something new and delicious. From the super local home kitchens to the most famous tea shop, we were able to walk right in and get amazing service. What a great way to learn about the food culture of Hoi An. thank you!" },
                { author: "Madeleine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "WE LOVED IT! Vỹ was such a fantastic guide, very knowledgeable and made us feel very comfortable straight away. The food was amazing and Vỹ was so accomodating even taking us into some vintage stores along the way. We definitely recommend this tour and it is a must do whilst in Hoi An!" },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Our tour guide, Uyen, did a fantastic job showing our group around Hoi An and explaining the history behind the different dishes we were trying. The places we ate at seemed like true, local spots, and were some of the best food we had during our Vietnam trip. Would definitely highly recommend for anyone traveling to Hoi An!" },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "friendly, knowledgeable and made me feel at ease even though I was only member on tour! Great English also." },
                { author: "Arisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Food is one of the highlights of traveling in Vietnam, and this tour was a wonderful way to discover the food culture of Hoi An. We visited a great mix of well-known local favorites and hidden places that we would never have found through guidebooks, websites, or social media. Every dish was delicious, and the selection of stops was excellent. Our guide, Nhuoc, was very friendly and knowledgeable, and thanks to him, we were able to learn much more about Hoi An’s food and local life. We joined with our two sons, aged 9 and 7, and they both said this was one of the most enjoyable experiences of" },
                { author: "Alecia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "Excellent, lots of good food, experience and knowledge about the food, family and culture. would do again" },
                { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "Our food tour was great! We really enjoyed going to people’s homes, and our guide had lots of recommendations." },
                { author: "Hilary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "An excellent tour, a real food adventure. Eating at small family restaurants it was a real insight into local specialities and ancient recipes. A real social history as well as a food tour. Our guide was very knowledgeable and friendly. Thoroughly recommend." }
