  'grandma-s-home-cooking-class-with-market-tour-in-hoi-an': {
            averageRating: 4.96,
            totalReviews: 82,
            guideRating: 4.97,
            valueRating: 4.81,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "It was a real treat to meet Thom, the guide and chef. She made our trip to the market and the whole day so enjoyable and educational. I can't say enough good things about this tour. It was the highlight of our Vietnam trip!" },
                { author: "Lacey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-15", text: "My husband and I loved the guide for the market “Thom” as well as our guide during the cooking class, “Na”. Everything was explained super well, felt very informative and very hands on. We enjoyed having the boat transportation, a fun thing that’s different than the normal mini van on tours. The food was delicious & we appreciated the well made recipe booklet to take home!" },
                { author: "Agata", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-15", text: "amazing day, learnt so much and was fun! recommend if coming to hoi an to get a local experience" },
                { author: "Erika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-01", text: "I highly recommend this experience! My two daughters and I had an amazing day. Thom, our guide, was wonderful – kind, funny, and knowledgeable. She made the tour not only informative but also so enjoyable. We began at the markets, where we learned so much about the variety of fruits, vegetables, and herbs essential to Vietnamese cuisine. The cooking part was equally fantastic – the dishes we prepared were absolutely delicious! It was a perfect way to immerse ourselves in Vietnamese culture and cuisine." },
                { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-22", text: "I had an incredible experience on this Vietnamese cooking tour with my husband! Our guide, Thom, was absolutely wonderful. She started the day by taking us on a stroll through a vibrant market, where we explored a variety of fresh fruits, vegetables, herbs, and spices. It was so interesting to learn about the local ingredients and how they’re used in Vietnamese cooking. Afterward, we biked to a beautiful house where we had the opportunity to cook traditional dishes. The entire cooking experience was fantastic, and Thom explained everything clearly and thoughtfully. She’s so sweet and engaged u" },
                { author: "Harry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-13", text: "Market tour was great with guide very knowledgeable. Boat transfer to grandmas was fun and cooking class excellent!" },
                { author: "Linda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-28", text: "Definitely worth it! We had a great experience in the markets learning about local food trade, ingredients, and trying different local fruits. The boat ride was pleasant and not too far. The village kitchen was inviting and well equipped with traditional and modern equipment. We were involved in every aspect of the food preparation, and felt very welcome by the family. My 2 tips.... #1 Get the full experience and go to the markets for the purchase of ingredients. #2 Don't eat breakfast that morning before going...so much good tasty food. Enjoy!" },
                { author: "Thibault", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-07", text: "Excellent workshop by Thom! she explains everything very well and the dishes are delicious!" },
                { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-21", text: "Very nice. Thom has a great story and knows a lot about the Vietnamese kitchen and ingredients. Would definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Marie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-01", text: "It was the best trip so far. Really a highlight of my trip." },
                { author: "Cara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-07", text: "We had a wonderful time on this tour, from a trip to the local wet market to the boat ride to the island where the cooking class was held. Our guide was fun and personable and we enjoyed learning how to make a number of dishes which differ from those most of the other cooking classes seem to offer. We left the tour full and culturally enriched, armed with a cookbook to recreate the dishes we made back at home." },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-06", text: "We had the best guide we could wish for. Nice to see people keeping the actual local spirit alive." }
            ]
        },
