            reviews: [
                { author: "Blanca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "This tour is very complete. You get a full taste of Hoi An and of its best attractions. My guide was extremely patient in explaining everything. Highly recommend it" },
                { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "Tom, is a great guide. very patient and answered all the questions on a very detailed way. We felt special for the tour provided" },
                { author: "Caro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "Guide was a great fountain of knowledge. Brilliant array of sights." },
                { author: "Micko", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "My tour guide was great. Very informative, friendly and funny. He took me to some really interesting spots and the coconut boat ride was fun. Great company and fantastic value for money. I would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Jack", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Very nice tour. Wonderful guide !! beautiful scenery, old pagode in Hoi An, the rice fields, Tre Que Vegetable Village and the boattrip in bamboo boats. We really enjoined everything" },
                { author: "Damian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "We all enjoyed our bike ride. Our guide was friendly and informative. Would recommend for anyone wanting to do something different and memorable. A great way to see another side of Hoi An." },
                { author: "Chloe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "We had the best afternoon biking around the countryside with Nhat. The whole tour was very informative and scenic with lots of mini activities involved. Nhats English was incredible we had a lovely afternoon in his company. Seeing the beautiful sunset was a plus! Would definitely recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "We had the best time on our tour!! Sun (our guide) was so welcoming and very knowledgeable! He was able to answer all our questions. He bought so much energy to the trip. The bike ride was stunning through the fields, especially towards sunset time. Could not recommend this tour enough!!" },
                { author: "Steven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "We had the best time! What an experience. The cycling was wonderful through the rice paddies was lovely. And Nhat just made it so enjoyable, thoroughly enjoyed our interactions with him - and he kept us going with the flow as we cycled out of and back into town." },
                { author: "Joanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Karla was a brilliant tour guide. She provided lots of information about Hoi An, the area and the lifestyle. We got so much more than we expected from this trip. Loved sampling a detox tea at the organic farm and trying lots of unusual fruits from a local market. I would strongly recommend this trip and especially Karla." },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "This was a brilliant way to see the rela Hoi An, a small group, only 3. we cycled at a slow pace around the villages and rice fields. Hoàng out guide was fantastic and gave us so much history and cultural information. my highlight was the vegetable village and coconut boat, we were taken down the river away from the busy tourist spot and it was very relaxing and fun!" },
                { author: "Yas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "This was a great little tour with a small group - lots of interesting and beautiful sites, and the perfect length of time ending with a peaceful basket boat ride with the river seemingly to ourselves. Q was a great tour guide with lots of insight who made the tour extra awesome with her fun and friendly personality - she is a superstar! ; 🙌🏽" }
            ]
