            reviews: [
                { author: "Bryon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Very fun and friendly with beautiful sights. Must do for your trip" },
                { author: "Harsh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "I really enjoyed the tour! We went for scuba diving and snorkelling. Very friendly guides! There was hotel pickup and drop off so it’s very convenient!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Guide très gentil et sympa. Aucune explication pour la plongée / scuba diving, juste équipé puis enfoncer dans l'eau. Restaurant du déjeuner vraiment horrible, je vous conseille de prendre à manger dans votre sac vous-même." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "魚をかなり近くで見られる貴重な体験ができた上、ビーチで現地の食事などを楽しむことができた" },
                { author: "Dorita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Das Schnorcheln war super schön, davon hätte ich mir noch ein bisschen mehr gewünscht. Ein Traum! Essen war super und reichlich, Organisation ebenfalls gut! Unser Guide war sehr sympathisch und hat uns mit vielen interessanten Informationen versorgt. Den Ausflug in den Deckenladen hätte man sich schenken können. Insgesamt ein schöner Tag, Danke dafür" },
                { author: "Lynn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-07-21", text: "wider area to dive and snorkel around. also to have snorkels and masks available to use, once the dive is over." },
                { author: "Shinichiro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-30", text: "今回、日本から初めてダナンにきましたが ガイドさんの案内がわかりやすく 島内を回ったり、ダイビングやシュノーケリングもスムーズに楽しめました！また、ツアーなので共に泳いだ仲間達ともランチをし仲良くなれました！また，やりたいと思うし初めての方にはおすすめのツアーです！" }
            ]
