                { author: "Tina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Great activity, we only booked that day and found it was only us two for the time we chose. Helpful and interesting and no big push to buy from their shop. My favourite was the coconut iced coffee" }
