  'hoai-river-night-boat-trip-and-floating-lantern-in-hoi-an': {
            averageRating: 4.44,
            totalReviews: 37,
            guideRating: 4.58,
            valueRating: 4.6,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-28", text: "Was unable to make it on my original booking but they were able to accommodate for the next night. Super helpful and was a quick and easy activity. Highlight was them assisting me in still getting the lantern and night boat trip" },
                { author: "Gail", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-14", text: "magical experience..we were the only 3 on boat so it was great ..would definitely recommend 10/10" },
                { author: "Mike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-18", text: "Well organised, and a lovely experience, highly recommended" },
                { author: "Susanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-02", text: "We very much enjoyed our experience on the river. Our boat paddler was friendly. He took lots of good pictures for us. Being on the river with so many colorful lanterns is a memory I will hold dearly." },
                { author: "Hayley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-14", text: "Amazing activity! A MUST do while in Hoi An! Our guide was very nice, and we were quick to get on the boat even though it was a busy time! Beautiful lanterns, and stunning scenery. Our guide even showed us the best place to get shoes made, but unfortunately we did not have enough time!" },
                { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-19", text: "Our boat guide was great, took numerous pics of us." },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-04", text: "It was fun to experience but it would have been nice if they explained a little about why they do it. It all felt a little rushed just too get the next people on board" },
                { author: "Elvira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Das Gute zu Beginn: der Guide war pünktlich am vereinbarten Treffpunkt und es ging ohne Wartezeit auf‘s Boot. Ansonsten reine Massenabfertigung. Dicht an dicht mit anderen Booten. Die Laterne wird einfach so zwischendurch ins Wasser gesetzt und wenn man Pech bleibt sie gleich am nächsten Boot hängen. Ein eigentlich schöner Brauch, der in der Masse völlig untergeht. Die Bootsfahrt geht höchstens 10 Minuten und ist eigentlich keine richtige Bootsfahrt sondern nur ein Gedränge. Wir würden es nicht noch einmal machen und auch nicht weiterempfehlen." },
                { author: "antonina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2026-01-04", text: "É stato tutto molto veloce. Dopo un minimo ci hanno fatto accendere la lanterna e metterla in acqua alla velocità della luce. Sconsiglio fortemente questa esperienza perche, nonostante il basso prezzo, non ne vale assolutamente la pena!" },
                { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-23", text: "Quedáis en un punto que está a unos minutos del Río y allí directamente se espera la fila y os montáis en la barca" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-10", text: "o passeio de barco foi engraçado." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-06-15", text: "We communicated with rose that we had a flight to catch, and so punctuality is very important. We got there on time, waited for 40 minutes because they and I quote “have problem with police” and missed the opportunity to send a lantern because of this. I would NOT recommend booking with them. While we were waiting they were also completely unresponsive even though they were online. It was a frustrating and disappointing experience to say the least." }
            ]
        },
