  'e-car-duck-and-buffalo-farming-local-experience-in-hoi-an': {
            averageRating: 4.87,
            totalReviews: 8,
            guideRating: 4.87,
            valueRating: 4.87,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Anastasiia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "We really enjoyed this tour! We visited a vegetable farm where we could water the plants ourselves, rode a beautiful and well-cared-for buffalo, and had fun in traditional bamboo basket boats while trying to catch crabs. The free lunch at the end was delicious. Everything was well organized, and we highly recommend this experience!" },
                { author: "Nicholas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "Amazing tour with excellent english speaking guide. We are picked up on time with an electric buggy car, visited a farm and was shown how to do traditional Vietnamese farm. Rode a buffalo and finished up the day with bamboo basket. Overall amazing experience with professional service." },
                { author: "Markus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "This tour really is highly recommended. We had a brilliant day as a family with Le Man as our fantastic guide. It was very varied. First the goose farm, then a ride on a water buffalo, a visit to a farm and then a bamboo boat trip. It was all a once-in-a-lifetime experience!" },
                { author: "Inguna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Visfantastiskakā ekskursija!!! Mums ļoti patika, gide Quin ir sava amata profesionāle. Viņa stradā ar patiesu degsmi un interesi, aizrauj ar stātiem par Vjetnamu. Mēs redzējām rīsa un lotosa laukus, bijām ekoloģiskajā saimniecībā, kur pašiem bija iespēja visu izbaudīt un nogaršot. Barojām pīles!!! Bijām pie bifeļiem, varējām tos apmīļot un braukt ar tiem. Bijām kanālā, kur var braukt ar apaļajām laivām. Ļoooti piesātināts laiks. Izbaudījām! Man žēl, ka vēl tik maz novērtējumu šajai fantastiskajai ekskursijai! Brauciet ar elektrisko auto un Quin!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-13", text: "The activities were different, fun and family friendly 😊" },
                { author: "Beata", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "Świetny czas, bardzo wiele ciekawych informacji. Bardzo sympatyczni, uśmiechnięci przewodnicy. Bardzo, bardzo polecam.!!!" }
            ]
        },
