                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "We had a good and stressless day in Ba Na - Guide Lin was very competent and nice - we skipped all the lines and never had waiting times during the trip. Food was excellent - also the free time in the afternoon was good!" },
                { author: "Mery", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-26", text: "Book this excursion with tour guide LIN! He was fun, funny, organized, and professional. The international buffet was okay." },
                { author: "Mihai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "The tour was entertaining, full of information and we had luck and catch a little bit of sun for Golden Bridge. The tour guide Lin shared with us a lot of his knowledge and some jokes too. I recommend this tour with Lin." },
                { author: "Grzegorz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-31", text: "Mr. LIN was super caring and helpful. His english is better than 99% other tour guides, what helped much. Tour was nice, i recommend not to spend 300,000 vnd on line skipping ticket. It took us maybe 15 min longer adding all the time spent there. Generally we wish every tour is this quality." },
                { author: "Jahi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "I have done so many tours on this app and Jun is the best tour guide I’ve ever had! He is SO friendly and takes some of the best pictures. Not only did he give us the background and history of our tour, but he also gave us local recommendations for our stay for the rest of our trip. You can tell Jun really loves his job and just wants you to have the best experience in his country. I can’t recommend this tour and Jun as your guide enough! :)" },
                { author: "Luis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-23", text: "We did the tour with Jun and it was a fantastic experience. He was a very friendly guide, full of energy, and really kept the tour lively from beginning to end. He took us through all the main highlights. I had been to this place before, but honestly, I had missed quite a few corners. With Jun, you can be sure you’re seeing the most relevant and interesting spots. Lunch was at a buffet in Bana Hills, which offered two options: Asian and Indian. We chose the Asian buffet and really enjoyed it: there was a wide variety of food, something for everyone. Highly recommended, both the tour and the gu" },
                { author: "Marion", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-11", text: "We had a wonderful day thanks to our very kind and helpful guide Lin. He even gave us tips for our stay in Vietnam, including good addresses in Da Nang. Cam On Lin!" },
                { author: "Anastasia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-06", text: "Our guide JUN was very thoughtful and helpful, providing us with all necessary information and aspects of the tour, making it special!" },
                { author: "Kalli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-13", text: "We had a lovely time with our guide mr June today! We was really helpful with everything we asked for and we enjoyed the tour so much. Ba Na Hills is a must see when in Vietnam in any case. Totally recomended" },
                { author: "Giovanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-06", text: "We had an amazing day in Ba Na Hills—and that’s mostly thanks to our awesome guide, Lin, whose professionalism (and brilliant sense of humor!) made everything better. We really appreciated how clearly he explained everything we needed to know to soak in the beauty of the place. Huge thanks for his patience and for knowing exactly where and when to snap the perfect shots of the Golden Bridge. This trip is 100% worth it from every angle. And trust us—the French Village alone is enough reason to clear out your phone’s storage. And if, on top of all that, you’re lucky enough to get the kind of gor" },
                { author: "Elvira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-03", text: "Lin is the best guide for this trip! Super friendly and expert about all things inside the park, so he gave us a lot of tips to enjoy the day! I recommend this trip to all of people want enjoy a beautiful day in Ba Na Hills and Golden bridge as well. It was a memorable day for us!" }
