                { author: "Ashrujeet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-01-22", text: "Unfortunately, there was nothing good in this trip. First, the guide and driver were not in sync which resulted in miscommunication about hotel pick up time resulting in us waitingat the hotel lobby for more than 30 mins. Secondly, there was no prior communication from the operator regarding pick up and trip. There was simply no initiative from the guide. Third, driver didn't speak English. The guide also spoke in broken English making communication very challenging. Fourth, the guide was always in a rush and had no inclination to engage with the tourists...we didn't need him for directions fr" }
