                { author: "Josephine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "The activities and stops were spaced out nicely between the driving! Binh was awesome, we had so much fun and he made me feel safe! Great adventure and lots of fun!!" },
                { author: "Clement", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "It was so amazing to make the trip with Van and Louis !!!! I only can recommend it 😊😊" },
                { author: "Anshul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Louis/Quy, Louis did a great job taking care of us. He made sure we were safe, fed, and happy. I highly recommend." },
                { author: "Ben", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Had a fantastic time with Hieuv and his team, saw unforgettable sights and made some lifelong memories. Would highly recommend" },
                { author: "Marek", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Experienced Guids and responsible as Well. My 1st time on motocycles. The timeplan was Well managed so it was great." },
                { author: "Luc", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Really nice drivers and good food on the way, would recommend it to anyone!" },
                { author: "Ewen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Ban is a handsome guy, best driver, love thuoc lao and happy water. I recommend this guy and this company. Hostels are good, food is good, very fun moment with everybody!!" },
                { author: "Youenn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Amazing, I definitely recommend this activity. All the drivers were amazing with us. Binh was my drivers and it was perfect 👌" },
                { author: "Nicholas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Ha giang is the single most beautiful place on earth without a doubt, I had an incredible experience. My driver Dat was super friendly and even though we drove for multiple hours every day I never felt unsafe. Our group leader Louis was also amazing and spoke great English so there were no issues following instructions. 10/10!" }
