                { author: "louise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-16", text: "Our guide was really friendly, he spoke impeccable French, and his explanations about the city, the country, and Ho Chi Minh City were truly fascinating and interesting. A wonderful arrival in Hanoi. Many thanks!" },
                { author: "Camila", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-18", text: "We absolutely loved this tour in Hanoi! It was incredibly well put together and took us to places we would’ve never found on our own. But without a doubt, the real star of the tour was our guide, Chin. Chin is not only extremely knowledgeable about history, but he also shared fun stories and local anecdotes that made everything even more engaging. What really stood out, though, was how kind, patient and caring he was with my parents (both over 70). He never rushed them, always waited, and made sure they were comfortable the whole time and honestly, that meant so much to us. He also shared fant" },
                { author: "Vilma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-30", text: "Our guide Luke was great. The tour helped orientate us - so the rest of our time in Hanoi was easy. It was also nice having a decidates private car driver. The tour was flexible and we added and changed things to suits us. Recommend this." },
                { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-25", text: "We had a great tour. Lucas was on time and very friendly. He was very knowledgeable and helped us amend the tour as the Mausoleum was closed on the day we did it. His insights on Buddhism and on Confucius were really interesting. The mini bus was comfortable and air conditioned." },
                { author: "Zak", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-19", text: "We really enjoyed the tour. Our guide Duy was excellent, friendly and helpful. He easily adapted the tour to meet our preferences. Recommended!" },
                { author: "Lynn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-02", text: "Great tour which covers all the important tourist attractions in Hanoi. Our tour guide Lucas (Phoc) was excellent and very easy to communicate with. He was happy to accommodate any requests and had planned a very good itinerary including ensuring that we got to see the train pass through the train street. The vehicle was also very comfortable with good seats and air conditioning." },
                { author: "Johanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-19", text: "Tuong tour guide was excellent. Pleasant person and shared interesting insight into Vietnam culture and society. Very efficient and well organized." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-06", text: "Harry was a great guide, very informative, and added additional stops to the itinerary so that we could see everything we wanted to in Hanoi. Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Zoé", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-30", text: "We had a full tour of the main attractions of Hanoi. Transportation between the places was seamless and very well organised by our guide. Our guide was extremely knowledgeable and kind and even though his English was not perfect we understood everything and discovered a lot about the history of the city." },
                { author: "Kara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-19", text: "What a great way to spend our first day in Hanoi! Duc gave us a wonderful customized tour of many highlights as well as a lot of history and fascinating information. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-08", text: "This was our first time in Hanoi and the tour was very informative. Our guide Duc was very nice and incredibly well informed. He told us lots about the history of Vietnam and current affairs. It was a very comfortable tour as we were being driven around the city to the various attractions. I would recommend this tour." }
