                { author: "Ameya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-26", text: "It was fantastic, the landscape was amazing. I enjoyed the boat ride and climbing up to the mountain. The guide was very informative and passionate about his work" },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "Bobby and Mr Bao were amazing! Bobby was our guide and had extensive knowledge of all the areas and Vietnam to field lots of questions. We went as a couple and ended up with just 4 people in total in our group (we were joined by another lovely couple), we really enjoyed this being a small group so this worked well for us! Notes on the trip - definitely bring cash for the boat tour! It’s important to tip your boat driver, especially as they want you to buy a souvenir during the ride. I would also recommend to tell your guide if you aren’t good with bikes in advance as they can make sure you’re" },
                { author: "Vaggelis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-04", text: "it was an excellent trip. ken was very helpful and welcoming. thank you again!" }
