                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2025-06-20", text: "Lieber mit Grab die Sehenswürdigkeiten selbst anfahren. Ist wesentlich günstiger, da der Audioguide nicht zu verstehen ist. Die Kopfhörer haben immer Wackelkontakt." },
                { author: "Dagmar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-10", text: "Vse probehlo tak jak bylo popsane" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "la visite est complète et donne un très bon aperçu de cette ville très étendue, c'est pratique et instructif." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-19", text: "Wir waren zufrieden. Leider konnten wir den deutschsprachigen Guide nur schlecht verstehen" },
                { author: "Jackie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-02-08", text: "Boarding in the morning is easy but it is very hard to hop on when on the route. There is not signage where to get the bus and the app doesn’t work well. We had to walk all the way back to the original pickup point to get back on the bus. The recorded guide cuts off and you don’t get the entire info. It was just okay overall." }
