  'bai-dinh-trang-an-mua-cave-full-day-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.69,
            totalReviews: 242,
            guideRating: 4.72,
            valueRating: 4.52,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-20", text: "Great value for money, Duyen was a brilliant tour guide who spoke excellent English (also some Mandarin 😅). Plenty of time prepared to do all of the activities without rushing. Bus was very spacious and comfortable also. Highly recommend." },
                { author: "Perla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-15", text: "This trip was absolutely incredible and so totally worth the price! We had the chance of seeing so many incredible things. I personally loved the Bái Ðính Temple and the caves. The Lying Dragon Mountain was definitely quite the hike, so make sure you are wearing comfortable shoes and clothes as the steps can get quite steep. A massive thank you goes to our guide Tony who patiently talked us through the beauties that the Ninh Bình province has to offer!" },
                { author: "Cameron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-05", text: "the tour was great, the guide took lots of pictures of me which is great. the scenery was amazing and the lunch was quite nice." },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-12", text: "It was amazing! Tree was the best guide, super welcoming and made us feel really valued in our ideas regarding the activities! Great day overall!!" },
                { author: "Steven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-08", text: "We had a great tour. Our guide, Hop, was wonderfully informative and very accommodating. The lunch buffet was so-so, but we didn't really sign up because of the food. We particularly liked the bike ride and the long boat ride through some wonderful scenery." },
                { author: "Dylan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-30", text: "Tour was excellent! We spoke Vietnamese which helped out a lot when participating in activities and interacting with the locals, so hoping that the guides will be able to go on the activities and explain things to those who don’t speak the language. Free traditional hat was a bonus!" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-10", text: "The trip was amazing. The mountain and river cruise was mind blowing and the scenery was absolutely incredible. Highly recommend taking it." },
                { author: "Holly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-23", text: "Guide was awesome: personable, funny, and knowledgeable. Loved the small group over large tour bus. Easy pickup/dropoff at our hotel. Comfy AC in van with reclining seats. Great combination of activities - walking, bike, boat ride, hike." },
                { author: "Marloes", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-22", text: "We had a great trip to the Ninh Binh area. Booked this one specifically because of the itinerary, we wanted a tour that combined Bai Dinh Pagoda, An Trang boat tour and also the Mua Caves, which was the perfect combination for us. And it even included some biking trough a local village which was also very nice despite the heat! We saw so many things! Hai was a great guide, very enthousiastic, and often offered to take some photos which was great! The pagoda was nice. We loved the boat trip through An Trang, it was extremely beautiful and not too short. We were also very happy with the conical" },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-20", text: "Excellent tour. The van was the best I've ever been in, the lunch was good, the guide great, all around an awesome day! The climb at the end is a bit brutal if you suffer in the humidity." },
                { author: "Catalin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-05-27", text: "The overall trip is definitely worth doing. Even though it is a day trip, it didn't feel very rushed. The bike ride is great, there is a buffet for lunch and food is enough and diversified. The boat ride takes about 2h and they split in groups of min 3 people." },
                { author: "Massimo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-03-24", text: "It was a very intersting and intense Tour! We loved it, besides If the fact that we would have loved to spend a Little more time on a few spots. Time felt a little short. But still, Great experience" }
            ]
        },
