                { author: "Maureen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Great way to see Hanoi. Our guide Duong was brilliant. Would definitely recommend" },
                { author: "Jenny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "Nick and our driver were brilliant. we had a great morning viewing the sites of Hanoi and Nick taught us about the history and background to what we were seeing. our driver was very safe navigating the busy city streets." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-12", text: "Tour was amazing, and so was our tour guide. Great experience." },
                { author: "GABRIELA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "We booked this last minute after getting a bit overwhelmed by the traffic mess and how busy Hanoi old quarter is to walk around. We thought this tour would be a good way to get our bearings and we were right. Our guide, Nam, was so wonderful. He is knowledgeable, friendly and ensured we got a lot of information. We found the value for money was incredible. You get a delicious Buncha lunch and go to a lot of iconic spots. I highly recommend this tour for people getting to Hanoi for the first time!" },
                { author: "Ally", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "We had a great day and Nam was an excellent tour guide. Highly recommended. Thank you Nam." },
                { author: "Felicia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-29", text: "I joined on the first day arriving in Hanoi. Very nice way to see and get introduced to the city. Our guide Paul was so friendly, helped us take great pictures and explained the history of North Vietnam" },
                { author: "Meshari", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-29", text: "Great experience to see Hanoi in whole, we saw everything and Sam was great with the tour, he explained to us everything and showed us. Great ride and great company. Would recommend this to everyone coming to Hanoi!" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "The best way to explore the City, the guide and the driver were amazing and also informed us about a lot of things in the city. It was a great experience, we would definitely recommend it, if you are coming to the Hanoi for the first time !! 10/10" },
                { author: "MARY-ANNE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-17", text: "Kin was an excellent guide he was knowledge and friendly. Would highly recommend this tour to anyone wanting to see Hanoi sights." },
                { author: "Annouk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-17", text: "An absolute must for first timers, and alike, to Hanoi. Seeing and experiencing the highlights and the real Hanoi with a very knowledgeable local guide. All the inside information of their culture and traditional beliefs. Delivered with much enthusiasm and cultural understanding. An amazing local Vietnamese lunch. Followed there after by the home of the original egg coffee. Thoroughly enjoyed it and highly recommend." },
                { author: "Warwick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-06", text: "What a great way to see Hanoi. Our guide and our driver looked after his perfectly. Worth every dollar and would happily do it again. You experience much more from an open car. The meal was also beautiful." }
