                { author: "Cristina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-28", text: "The new War Museum is a great looking building. The outdoor planes and tanks were cool to see in person. Inside the Museum is huge! Thankfully we had a very knowledgeable tour guide called Mike who was able to sum up about 4000 years of Vietnamese history in 1 hour. It was a very informative walk through and you could tell he was passionate about the subject. We were also celebrities to the school kids! They are from outside of Hanoi so are not used to seeing foreigners, and asked for photos, very cute. We chose to visit the prison as part of this tour after the Museum, and whilst confronting" }
