  'hanoi-city-motorbike-tour-with-female-riders-and-train-street-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.89,
            totalReviews: 29,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.94,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "The tour was lovely! Huong and My were lovelies and really interesting! We learned so much about the Vietnamese culture and discovered much more than the touristic places! Thank you so much for the tour! Recommend!!!!!" },
                { author: "My-lien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "It was a really fun day! We really enjoyed the company of our tour guide and female drivers. It was really safe even with two teens. I highly recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Matias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-15", text: "I had such an amazing experience! Lovely tour taking you to the must see spots all over Hanoi. Visiting a local farm in Banana Island was a great opportunity to see a different side of the city. Hadea is such an amazing guide, she knows everything and is very welcoming and friendly. She recommended lots of cool places to try food and continue enjoying this beautiful city. Thanks so much!" },
                { author: "Suzie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-16", text: "Jay was an amazing and skilled rider she made me feel safe - her local and historic knowledge great and I found the tour interesting with a few places to visit and great lunch and coffee! I had the best fun!! It really was a fantastic ending to my holiday here - Suzie -Australia" },
                { author: "Shun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "Our half day with Vicky and Trang were the highlight of our hanoi trip. They took us through all the tourist spots and went with our pace so it was perfect timing. We had heaps of fun along the way and there was alot of laughter. Honestly the highlight of our time in Hanoi, will be coming back with other friends." },
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-11", text: "Had a great morning seeing all the sights with my guide Hadea. She was very knowledgeable about the city, sharing interesting facts along the way and at each stop. It was so fun seeing the city from the back of a bike! And I felt safe at all times. She also got the best photos of me! Overall a great morning and I would highly recommend this unique way to see Hanoi." },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "Great experience, very knowledgeable and fun. learned some interesting things and a great way to see the city. Hadei was my guide and she was very friendly." },
                { author: "Markus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "Excellent tour will book same team again if possible when we get back with friends next time . Very friendly and accommodating and very safe drivers" },
                { author: "Connie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "We had a great tour with Jay and Kim. They showed us lots of interesting sites and explained many things about Vietnamese history and culture. During the morning we had coffee at Train Street, which was very cool. Went to Banana Island and had tea with a local farmer. Finishing the day off with a great lunch. I highly recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-17", text: "We had an absolutely fantastic time on the E-Scooter tour with Vicky and Capy! From start to finish, everything was handled with professionalism, energy, and genuine enthusiasm. They made the whole experience feel effortless and fun, while also making sure we felt completely safe and comfortable riding on the back. Vicky and Capy were friendly, engaging, and full of great insights, which really added to the experience. Their sense of humor and easygoing nature made it feel relaxed and personal the whole way through. We couldn’t recommend them highly enough—an excellent experience all around! —" },
                { author: "Loius", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "The female riders motorbike tour was one of the most fun and inspiring experiences of my trip. The riders were confident, friendly, and highly skilled, making the whole journey feel both exciting and safe. Cruising through busy streets and hidden corners gave me a real glimpse into local life, with stops at authentic spots I’d never find on my own. What made it stand out was the connection—the riders shared stories and genuine moments, not just a route. More than just a tour, it was empowering to see strong women leading the experience. Highly recommended if you want something authentic, fun," },
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "It was fantastic. Vicky and Capy are the best guides in Hanoi!" }
            ]
        },
