                { author: "Anastasia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "We had a wonderful day! Our guide, Sophie, was so warm, friendly, and full of energy. This tour is especially great for families with children. Our kids loved making the incense sticks themselves, and decorating the traditional hats was one of the highlights of our trip. Thank you, Sophie, for such a lovely day. We highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Hanoi!" },
                { author: "Mariska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-10", text: "A wonderful half-day trip and a great way to experience the Vietnamese countryside just a short drive from the Old Quarter. The incense village was beautiful and made for some incredible photos. We also loved learning about traditional hat making and trying our hand at painting. The interactive experiences kept our kids engaged throughout, making it an enjoyable outing for the whole family. Our guide, Harry, was fantastic—friendly, knowledgeable, and made the day both fun and informative. Highly recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Eliška", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "I had an incredible time on this trip! Our guide was so cheerful and kept us in great spirits the entire time. They didn’t just show us around; they shared fascinating stories and history that helped us truly understand the local culture and the mindset of the people living here." },
                { author: "Alesia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "This was a very good excursion. Harry was a charming and knowledgeable guide. The conical hats visit was informative, but it the incense village was the highlight of the tour. From the factory to the outstanding photo opportunities, it really stood out. It was an overall great experience. I recommend!" },
                { author: "Asvi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-30", text: "We really enjoyed our visit to the incense village. We learnt so much about Vietnamese culture and harry our guide was very entertaining and knowledgeable. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Aleksandrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-30", text: "It was a fun half a day trip from Hanoi. We enjoyed the hat making experience and unleashed our inner designers. The incense village was interesting to see the factory, but quite sad the poor working conditions and the salaries they get. That really struck a chord with us. The photo spot is good, and Lana took some really good photos of the whole group." }
