  'hidden-eats-and-full-meal-street-food-tour-in-the-old-quarter-in-hanoi': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 12,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Jagbir", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Was amazing to experience food a tourist would not as a lot of these were in alleyways." },
                { author: "Hortense", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "The tour was great with Phong, it turned out to be a private tour and the conversation was flowing, Phong adapted the tour to what I had already tried and to my preferences and provided explanations on the food and the local habits! Perfect to get a first start in the Vietnamese cuisine and culture, would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Kevin was an extremely likeable guy. Treated us like his family. We felt safe crossing the hectic streets of Hanoi with him. He had researched street vendors and gave us the background of their signature dishes. One of us was gluten free which he tailored into the tour. We weren’t disappointed at all. At our final stop was to try egg coffee .. we were apprehensive, but Kevin reassured we would love it. We were not disappointed Seven from Coffee Culture was awesome. We would highly recommend Kevin to anyone." },
                { author: "Sofie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "We had an amazing foodie tour with our guide Phong! He showed us some interesting places we wouldn’t normally visit as tourists. The food was really good, and we tasted many different food types. He was easy to understand, and told us about Hanoi and Vietnam." },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "We had a wonderful and enjoyable tour. We were taken to some truly interesting places, and all the food was excellent. Along the way, our guide shared fascinating stories that gave us a great insight into Vietnamese culture. We were a group of six people, and everything was well organized, making the experience easy, comfortable, and enjoyable from start to finish :)" },
                { author: "Hope", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-05", text: "Kevin was a great tour guide knew lots of interesting info and stories about the city was very interesting to listen to didn’t rush us through eating - & got to see how egg coffee was made at the end which was also very cool! He picked us up from our hotel also which wasn’t me mentioned in the deception and is a great plus as it saved us 20 mins walking to a meet up location! Would reccomend!" },
                { author: "Amanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "Phong was an excellent guide - we loved our food stops - well worth doing in Hanoi" },
                { author: "Le", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "Phong was an outstanding tour guide and made our Hanoi Old Quarter tour unforgettable. He was knowledgeable, friendly, and passionate about sharing the history, culture, and hidden gems of Hanoi. His local insights and recommendations made the experience truly authentic. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Hanoi!" },
                { author: "Ulrike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Fantastische food tour met Phong, die perfect Engels sprak en bovendien ook wat Nederlands kon. Nam ons mee naar verborgen plekjes en plekjes waar we anders nooit zouden binnen stappen. Overtrof zeker onze verwachtingen. Phong is een zeer goede gids, die geboeid kan vertellen over de Vietnamese (eet)cultuur en goed kan inspelen op de wensen van de deelnemers. Zouden we zeker aan anderen aanraden!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-07", text: "I had an amazing private tour with phong. He brings you around the old quarter telling you some history and bringing you to really local food spots. He speaks English very well, and the food is amazing. There is a lot of flexibility if you want to see something extra or try a different dish. I would really recommend" }
            ]
        },
