  'ha-giang-loop-3-day-2-night-2-way-bus-and-free-hostel-in-hanoi': {
            averageRating: 4.88,
            totalReviews: 15,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Romain", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-09", text: "The Ha Giang loop was our best life experience! The easy drivers were really great and prudent/safe on the road. The landscapes are sooo amazing, and the guide took time to explain to us some history and made many breaks for us to take photos and rest. Accommodations and food also were great: no one fell sick and the quantities were enough, and we slept well! I will highly recommend Ha Giang Go to my friends and family, it’s a once in a life experience!" },
                { author: "Ismaele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "An amazing experience, which left us without words. Thanks to the riders, very kind and friendly throughout the entire journey, we had the opportunity to discover the rural life of Vietnam. The Ha Giang Loop is a must-do in visiting this country, especially this one organised by Mr. Lee, who had the attention to prepare an incredible tour for us. I strongly recommend to spend at least three days in doing this journey, since it would easily turn out to be one of the greatest experience you have ever lived." },
                { author: "Lorenzo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "Amazing experience. I love all!!! Mr Lee, pita and their team are fantastic." },
                { author: "Hung", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "The trip is so good experience. The riders are professional drivers and are provided very timely service, also organised very good meals. We are happy and will suggest my friends to book this Ha Giang tour. Thanks so much HAGIANGGO Tour." },
                { author: "Astrid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Beautifully organised - I didn't have to worry about a single thing from transport before or after, dietry restrictions or safety. Great communication and informed group leader. Meant I could spend my time on the beautiful landscapes and making memories with the wonderful people in my group. Could not recommend enough:)" },
                { author: "Zcp", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "You could see lots of rice paddies and the old things back to the last century. Definitely recommended if you are a city guy. But ready for butt pain 🤣" },
                { author: "Camille", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "I had an incredible trip; we were lucky enough to see one stunning landscape after another, with very welcoming hosts and locals, as well as perfectly organised activities. A special mention goes to the best driver, if you have a choice, I highly recommend Grande krame*; he’s funny, cheerful, and I felt safe throughout my journey. It’s also thanks to him that this experience was so wonderful!!" },
                { author: "Andrei", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "One of the best travel experiences I’ve had in the past year! I did the 3-day, 2-night Ha Giang Loop with Ha Giang Go Motorbike and Tour, and everything was perfectly organized from start to finish. Even before I arrived, the staff helped arrange my sleeper bus from Hanoi, and booking the tour with them included a free night’s stay at their hostel in Ha Giang. The tour is truly all-inclusive. In the price everything from the great local food, authentic homestays, and incredible experiences like the boat trip on the Nho Que River was included. It was such a great feeling to simply relax and enj" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "My second time doing the loop and I decided to go with a different company and I'm so happy I did! It was so much more organized and peaceful. As opposed to a buffet style breakfast for example, Hagiang Go gave me options and prepared it fresh with an authenic coffee instead of that powdered stuff. The bus they arranged for me was also cleaner and safer. I felt more welcomed this time as opposed to feeling like I was rushed from place to place and my tour leader and easy rider were so much more relaxed and safe on the road not to mention their english was better than the other tour company I u" },
                { author: "Mandy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "wat een geweldig leuke ervaring om zo rond te toeren. ze doen er alles aan om je op je gemak te stellen. alles goed geregeld en zeer behulpzaam. wij raden dit echt aan om te doen!!! top ervaring" },
                { author: "jaquerod", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-09", text: "L’ensemble de l’équipe (guide et Easy Rider) étaient très sympas. Les paysages étaient magnifiques, l’organisation parfaite avec des lieux pour dormir très confortables et un bon nombre d’activités supplémentaire. Je vous recommande cette compagnie pour pouvoir profiter du vrai paysage et en même temps faire la Giang Loop avec beaucoup de fun." },
                { author: "Lilou", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "C’est la plus belle expérience de ma vie, les drivers sont incroyables et tellement gentil. J’en suis très reconnaissante. Les paysages sont magnifiques et sont à coupé le souffle. L’accueil hospitalière est génial. Nous ne manquons de rien! J’ai énormément rigolé ce fut un plaisir. Je le recommande fortement. Tellement j’ai aimé que je reviens dans deux semaines avec ma mère. Dédicace à « kham » le meilleure des driver ! Je l’aime trop." }
            ]
        },
