            reviews: [
                { author: "Corina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "Leon was an extremely friendly, open guide and explained everything to us really well. Both the incense stick production and hat production were really interesting. Thank you Leon. It was great to do this tour in a small group. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-20", text: "Tom a été adorable. Il a clairement voulu qu'on fasse un bon moment. Il etait très présent pour nous. Un grand merci à lui" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-04-12", text: "Es werden zu den Gebühren zusätzlich 30€ für‘s Fahren erhoben, was für vietnamesische Verhältnisse sehr teuer ist. Der Tourguide war supernett aber z. B. das „Weihrauchdorf“ ist ein einziges Scam. Das sind nicht wie auf den Fotos große Felder, sondern ein abgesperrter Bereich wo das stattfindet und im Hintergrund ist Bauzaun mit komischen Motiven. Man muss schon sehr justieren um den richtigen Winkel zu finden. dass die Fotos toll aussehen. Der Stopp danach bei den Lackbildern ist auch eine reine Kaufaufforderung. Würde die Tour nicht empfehlen. Zudem hieß es Abholung 8 Uhr, der Tourguideschri" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "All excellent. Mid size group and great tour guide" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-14", text: "Las actividades, poder conocer oficios de esta cultura. Demasiado rápido, ya que tardas mucho el recoger a los participantes. Con el tráfico de Hanoi y las carreteras en obras, paso a nivel de tren … cuando llegas prácticamente no te da tiempo a nada" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-20", text: "Great tour with Kevin to an incense village and conical hat painting. Trip was organised and value for money. Recommend trip." },
                { author: "Stéphanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-19", text: "Demi journée très intéressante avec Rachel une jeune guide très impliquée. J ai adoré aller à la découverte de la fabrication d encens et de chapeaux coniques! Petit plus nous avons pu peindre un chapeau en souvenir!!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-06", text: "Interesting to see! Rachel is a great guide!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-03-26", text: "L'esperienza nel suo complesso non ha soddisfatto le mie aspettative. La guida Liam è molto gentile, tuttavia il tempo per questa attività è stato mal gestito: troppo tempo al \"villaggio\" dei cappelli tipici vietnamiti, tempo di trasferimento molto lungo lungo (al mattino per recuperare tutti i partecipanti all'attività ci abbiamo impiegato circa 1 ora). Prezzo eccessivo per le attività proposte (26€ in 2). Durata totale dell'attività 7 ore, il villaggio dell'incenso dista circa 40 km da Hanoi." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-02", text: "The tour was great! Rachel (the guide) was extremely nice, very informative, and helped me taking some photos, as I was a solo traveller. The timing of the tour was great. Loved it!" },
                { author: "Meera", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-12-31", text: "Nice tour. Guide has been very supportive." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-25", text: "excelente muestra de la fabricación de incienso y de los típicos sombreros. nuestra guía Luisa muy agradable y simpática." }
            ]
