            reviews: [
                { author: "Lynda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Loved it all. The crazy traffic, the rain and the amazing food. Thank you Chi and Pineapple, you guys were great guides. I’ll be back!!" },
                { author: "Neil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Nick was a fantastic guide, very friendly and knowledgable" },
                { author: "Marco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-25", text: "Jay was an excellent guide and we enjoyed being taken around this wonderful city safely and with a great sense of the modern Hà Nội. Thank you" },
                { author: "Hayley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Nam is wonderful, down to earth and easy to talk to. He was great company while I have been solo travelling. He is very intelligent and knows worlds of information about the history of Vietnam. He had great recommendations for me and the food was delicious. I highly recommend touring with Nam / this tour group." },
                { author: "Jamie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-23", text: "You NEED to take this tour but you don't know you need to take this tour. it is really what Hanoi is all about." },
                { author: "Brett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-12", text: "Definitely a highlight of my stay in Hanoi. Linh was an amazing guide and tailored the experience to make it special. Riding around Hanoi on a Vespa is something everyone should experience once in their life. What a way to see this beautiful city. Thanks Linh!!!" },
                { author: "Luca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-11", text: "It was a great night tour on Vespa. It is amazing. Scooter is the most popular way to move around the city. You feel like local. You can see more or less all the most important place in Hanoi.. My guide tour guide Tin helped me to understand not only the place and the local food but also the culture behind that. And with night lights everything is better! Thanks Tin!" },
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "Tin was a fantastic guide. Warm and friendly, he was also incredibly knowledgeable about all things Vietnam and we learned as much from him as we thoroughly enjoyed the food and the sites. Join the tour - you’ll love it!" },
                { author: "Sukriti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "Linh’s Vespa tour was a highlight of our time in Hanoi. From the moment she picked us up, we felt safe and comfortable in the traffic. She was very patient and tailored the route to our interests, never rushing us. Linh explained the city’s history and culture in a way that was easy to relate to and full of local insight. She also took lots of cute couple photos for us and knew great spots for pictures. Beyond being a fantastic guide, she was just a joy to be around. We’d 100% recommend her to anyone visiting Hanoi." },
                { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-06", text: "Great tour and well looked after by our guides Tin and Trung. Went to some authentic restaurants we would not find ourselves. Extensive tour of the city finishing with beers on train street. Felt very safe on the back of the Vespas even in the manic Hanoi traffic. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "The tour was great and they were really helpful, my flight was late so i had to miss the first stop, but they kept me updated so that I could jump Im along the way when I arrived ☺️" }
            ]
