                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-04", text: "Amazing trip. Our guide Toan AKA Tony was brilliant. Our driver was really friendly and an excellent driver. I had booked the luxury jeep and this didn’t disappoint. The accommodation was surprisingly good. Our second one had a brilliant pool. And Karaoke entertainment." }
