  'ha-giang-loop-3-day-with-easy-rider-and-private-bungalow-room-in-hanoi': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 22,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.8,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Oliwia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "We did the Ha Giang Loop with Serenity and had an amazing experience! Everything went smoothly from start to finish. A special shoutout to our drivers, who were exceptionally careful and made us feel safe throughout the entire journey. We booked the tour for our group of four and ended up getting a private tour, which was an awesome bonus for us. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Mariska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Amazing tour with so many wonderful viewpoints. My easy rider was sweet and very helpful. The stay at the Serenity Bungalows was so good, these were the most comfortable beds I have slept in during my travels through Vietnam. The breakfast was good, the view from the room picturesque and the location just perfect walking distance from the centre. All in all a tour I would definitely recommend to book with Serenity. If I could book every tour with Serenity, I would." },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-12", text: "We had a great Trip and couldn’t have asked for better guides. Ha Giang is a beautiful place and the stops and activities that the guides take you to make it all the while. 3 days of riding was enough for us" },
                { author: "Damla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "Cat was out guide in a small group of two people, which was great because we were able to do many things very individually. I enjoyed the tour a lot, Cat took us to very remote place. Accommodation could be better in my opinion but at least it was a private one. A bit different than what i understand under bungalow. And you stay at the same place for 2 nights. I don’t know if we could see more, if we stayed in another village. Food was amazing. Overall very good experience, good value for the money you pay." },
                { author: "Raiden", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "Cat was an amazing guide. He drove very safely and made sure the whole group was cared for. With Cat & the team, you can rest assured that you are in safe hands. I highly recommend Serenity to do the Ha Giang Loop with. They were very professional, and took us to very unique spots off the beaten path. I will absolutely be doing this again with Serenity, 10/10. Cheers to Cat and the team!" },
                { author: "Ellie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-11", text: "Me and my cousin did the Hi Giang Loop with Serenity in May 2026. There were four people in our group, along with four easy riders. I can honestly say it is the best thing either of us has ever done. The views and scenery is beautiful, but what makes the trip is the people. Singh, Thanh, Ngoc and Bien were the most helpful, kind and funny people I’ve met. They made sure we had everything we needed and we were also comfortable and okay with what we were doing. They made us feel like we were one big family. I think the smaller groups are better, because you get to know one another on a more pers" },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Very good ride. A bit of misunderstandings on day 1 due to language. Once that was sorted we were well look after by Bak and his team. Thank you." },
                { author: "Léa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Very great experience, good drivers and amazing accomodations." },
                { author: "Serene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Easily one of the best highlights of our 2 week Vietnam trip. The Ha Giang Loop is truly a one of a kind, must see experience and we couldn’t have been happier with choosing this tour. We’ve had such an incredible experience on the tour and were pleasantly surprised by how nice the accommodations are, compared to the dorms we heard about with other tours. Our tour group consisted of 4 people, the drivers, and our tour guide Cat, who was lovely, extremely helpful in making sure all our needs were taken care of, and did a great job of showing us around. The small group dynamic definitely made it" },
                { author: "Matthieu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Best trip of my life. Amazing guide. Drivers are awesome. Recommand it for sure!" },
                { author: "Emilie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "I highly recommend Serenity! Our Easy-Drivers were very skilled and nice. We booked the private bungalow and we were stunned how clean and modern it looked. The service was excellent! We felt very comfortable and relaxed during this amazing tour. The only thing we were disappointed about was the waterfall. The waterfall is very small and very touristy. In summary we are satisfied and happy that we booked with serenity." },
                { author: "YOW", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "We do enjoy our 3 days trip, nice scenery, nice room, nice people." }
            ]
        },
