            reviews: [
                { author: "Arash", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "This was an amazing experience. The drivers were great and really professional and fun to be around. Our main leader Cua made us feel welcome and explained everything to us perfectly. I highly recommend them for anyone doing the loop. I hope to come back again." },
                { author: "Seán", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "This was an amazing experience. The scenery, the food, and the drivers were absolutely amazing. Would highly recommend anyone to book their Ha Giang Loop Tour through Hong Hao tours. My driver, Tuyen was amazing and a great tour leader." },
                { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "100% worth it We had an amazing experience with Alex our guide The easy rider were super nice and drove really safely. We had a lot of fun. It was one of my favourite experience of Vietnam. The food was really good and the hotels were perfect too. The landscapes were breathtaking The organisation was top level !!" },
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "Our guide Sun was amazing!! He made us feel very safe and comfortable when we were on the bikes and he always led the group with enthusiasm and joy. Our trip would not have been the same without him. We had the best time with our group and easy riders. Thank you so much, we will never forget such an incredible experience 🌟" },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "Really well run and enjoyable experience, all the easy riders were great, especially Hau and Sang" },
                { author: "Danielle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-03", text: "Amazing!! Such a wonderful experience and our guide, Perry, and our drivers were so incredible!" },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Been in Vietnam for 2 months and it was the best thing I did. Well worth the money and all the easy riders are magicians on a bike. Khuynh was a top bloke and great at his job being lead and guiding our group." },
                { author: "Bik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-28", text: "Had a fantastic time with Hoang Hao Ha Giang Trip. We did 4 days 3 nights with a group of 6 and everything went so smoothly. Nguyen as a tour leader was exceptional and he navigated the trip perfectly. They took all safety precautions and it's very obvious they are extremely familiar with the roads and best sites to see. All members of the group were treated so well and taken care of. The private rooms were also a nice touch compared to staying in a hostel. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Faith", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "I can’t recommend this enough, it was a life changing experience that I will never forget. I made some amazing memories, ate great food, saw breathtaking views and left with a renewed appreciation for life. My driver Tam was so funny and friendly. He was a very skilled driver and made me feel very safe throughout the whole journey. 10/10 ⭐️✨" },
                { author: "Harry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "We loved this experience and would recommend it to anyone. Our drivers Cò and A Lu were amazing. Both made us feel very safe and comfortable when on the bikes and made the experience very special. They were great guides and took us to some amazing viewpoints along the loop. Evening activities were also great and the accommodation and food was great also. Would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Tess", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-06", text: "The tour was so fun, Sun was such a great guide and the activities were so much fun. Food was delicious and accomodation was also quite good!" },
                { author: "Jamie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "Hai Gang loop was one of the best experiences I’ve ever done, drivers and team leaders are very nice and the nights spent with them were great. A lot of fun was had at the hostel with Karaoke and great food. Our guide Tony was very good and friendly and made the experience one of the best. Would highly recommend." }
            ]
