                { author: "Gill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-14", text: "Excellent the tour guide Chang was talkative and knowledgeable I would recommend her to future groups thinking of this tour of the Sapa valley" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Es war ein wirklich einzigartiges Erlebnis. Der Guide war sehr nett und hat sich viel Zeit für uns genommen. Das Hotel war top. Ein sehr großes, luxuriöses Zimmer (charm Hotel). Sehr nette Leute! Ich würde die Tour immer wieder buchen!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-11", text: "What a beautiful part of Vietnam the day trek was inspirational so glad I did this" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-22", text: "We received a warm welcome from Chang on arrival in SAPA and she immediately set about helping us with check in and lunch arrangements with the hotel. She was engaging and fun all the while also providing a lot of insights on life in SAPA, past, present and future hopes. My friend and I had the most amazing trekks through the villages. I highly recommend her as guide." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2023-11-03", text: "Der Fahrt von Hanoi war sehr angenehm mit dem Luxusbus. Unser Guide Gu war sehr freundlich und sie erzählte uns sehr viel von deren Kultur. Leider war das Hotel in einem schlechten Zustand. Die Isolierung war schrecklich wie auch die Reinigung der Zimmer. So wie es aussah, war ein Teil des Komplexes nicht fertig gebaut." },
                { author: "Emilie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2023-02-17", text: "J'ai été déçue par ce séjour. Le rapport qualité prix n'est pas du tout à la hauteur par rapport aux autres séjours proposés. Tout d'abord par l'hôtel qui n'était pas propre puis par le trek qui n'en était pas un. Les personnes avec lesquelles j'étais ne marchait pas du tout, du coup nous avons été obligé de moins marcher et de les attendre tout du long. Le programme a été changé en cours de route. Bref pas top. Les points positifs étaient la guide qui était géniale et tellement gentille et les paysages fabuleux. Le village de Cat Cat est incroyable. Essayez d'y aller quand il fait beau car av" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2022-11-12", text: "Great experience with Trang our guide who was really knowledgeable and showed us the local villages. The only disappointment was that the Fansipan cable car had been closed for repair and we hadn't been told in advance so the felt we had a wasted third day and would have preferred to have moved on after doing the cat cat village and long village walks in the other two days." }
