  'muong-hoa-valley-trek-and-lao-chai-ta-van-villages-tour-in-sapa': {
            averageRating: 4.98,
            totalReviews: 56,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "If you’re doing a day hike in Sapa book this tour! It was a lovely hike down the hill. We started in town and strolled out of town along the road. We then turned off and started walking through the rice fields passing through 3 towns which were all very lovely. Our guide Su was a local from the valley. He answered every question we had. It’s a family run trekking tour and he said they only run small groups. (On our hike it was just me and my girlfriend). I really recommend booking this!" },
                { author: "Alyse", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "This was the best experience! I went with my husband and we cannot recommend it enough. The route is beautiful and you see so much nature and culture. But the best thing is the guide, we went with Vang and she was incredible! It’s a business with her and her husband Su and they are both wonderful people. She answered all our many questions and offered loads of information throughout the tour and then we had a delicious lunch near her home village. It’s small groups too which feels very social and personal. If you’re in Sapa, do it!" },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-01", text: "We had an amazing time with Vâng! She told us so much about the cultures and villages, and answered all the other questions we had. We took an adventurous route with breathtaking views. I would definitely recommend this tour and would do it again!" },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-06", text: "We meet our guide Su in Sapa town then trekked down into ethnic villages & beautiful mountain passes. Su filled us with facts & information all along the way . We stopped for a lovely lunch which was included. After walking so far it was great to be met by a taxi to bring us up the hills to our starting point which was also included. The day was such great value for money & Su was a great guide. Highly recommended" },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "It was amazing! Our guide was awesome, she gave us an incredible experience. They also drop us off at our hotel with our bags after." },
                { author: "Patryk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "Su was an exceptional guide from start to finish. He was friendly, knowledgeable, and made the whole experience fun and engaging." },
                { author: "Laetitia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-16", text: "We had a wonderful day trekking in Sapa with our guide Gao! She is warm, professional, and showed us beautiful landscapes and local culture. We highly recommend her !" },
                { author: "Divo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-08", text: "A 100% recommend the tour, the guide (Su) is great and adapted the trek to the pace of the whole group and climate condition, during the route he explain lots things to you to better understand the context and how people live there. The difficulty is medium-hard, you have to have stamina to go down some of the paths especially if it is/was raining (can be really slipery). After lunch we were accompanied all the way back (2-3 hours) by a little girl and a woman who try to sell things, I know it's not part of the tour, I just want to ask you to not give money to childrens, they don't deserve to" },
                { author: "Angelina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-20", text: "We had a very nice day with Su. Was a really beautiful path and Su was a very good tour guide; informative, encouraging and lovely. Overall had a wonderful day." },
                { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-11", text: "Su guided us through the rice fields and traditional villages, where we learned a lot of interesting things about the locals. The views and information alone made the trip worthwhile. He speaks very good English, which made communication very easy. I recommend this trip to anyone who wants to get away from tourism and learn about the culture and life in Sapa. One more tip: if it has rained or is raining, be sure to wear muddy and non-slip shoes. Truly recommend Su to everyone!" },
                { author: "Joe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-10", text: "Our guide was incredible knowledgeable, patient, and full of stories. The guide took great care of us, even during the toughest parts of the trek. I felt safe and supported the whole time. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Chau", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-04", text: "I truly enjoyed this day tour with our guide, as he was very friendly and always helped each of us throughout the trip. Although it was raining and the roads were quite slippery, but i had a wonderful time in Sapa overall. Highly recommended this tour!" }
            ]
        },
