                { author: "Luqman", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-26", text: "We had an amazing time at Sapa, mainly because we had such a great guide. Tung was knowledgable and funny and told us lots of stories about the village and culture there. The hike was great, you get to walk through villages and see how the local people live, and accommodation in Ta Van village was clean and beautiful. Thank you so much Tung!" },
                { author: "Luqman", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-26", text: "I was so lucky to be able to go on this homestay and trek with an amazing tour guide in Soa. Soa was very knowledgable about her culture but so open to sharing. I felt like I left with really being taken care of. I hope to come back and experience the culture for a longer time. The trek is life-changing, you will not be disappointed." }
