  'herbal-trekking-tour-with-red-dao-people-1-day-in-sapa': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 24,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Terri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "We had a wonderful day with Nay our guide. She showed us the mountains, rice fields, bamboo forests, some villages; explained about herbal medicines, the culture of her tribe and others. More or less depending on how curious you are. We collected herbs as we walked, had a great lunch, a herbal bath in a big wooden barrel part way around and at the end a foot herbal bath and foot massage. There were options to do shorter or longer walks. Longest was 7 miles which we did. She was sooo lovely too. Went at our pace, stopped for water and photo breaks. You get a drink at the meeting point which was" },
                { author: "Harriet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Had the most amazing time on this trip, Nay our guide was so lovely, informative and caring. She really took all her time and made the trip so incredible. The walk was beautiful and informative, the lunch was delicious and the herbal bath and foot massage was such a nice addition! Really felt like I had an insight to the villages, tribes and nature we walked round. Couldn’t recommend this enough. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Wei", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "A wonderful day out! Our guide lo may is extremely knowledgeable with local herbs, she was very attentive and patient. We learned a lot about the local culture and herbal medicine. The herbal bath was great too!" },
                { author: "Annie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "We had a wonderful day out with Nay as our guide. She was very knowledgeable about the different plants and we get to smell and see them, she had a wonderful energy and we've even got joined by her dog as we walked through a neighbouring village. The landscapes and local insight really made this tour special. food, herbal bath were lovely. We recommend!!!" },
                { author: "daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-14", text: "This was an amazing experience. Nay was my tour guide and she was very knowledgeable in medicinal plants and I learned a lot about the Red Dao people. The herbal medicine bath was very refreshing and lunch was so delicious. I highly recommend you book a trekking tour with Nay!" },
                { author: "Vasilis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "Amazing tour with beautiful places to see,we did the herbal bath and was so worth it and relaxing and had local launch later. At the tour there are some local ladies that come and help you because at some points it's a bit difficult to cross the paths especially if it has rained before. Also are tour guide Nay was amazing and very kind, had wonderful time with her!" },
                { author: "Cihan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "The Tour was amazing! The views and spots we went to were absolutely impressive. We walked together with the Red Dao through the Bamboo Forest to their Village and could learn more about their life. Moreover we walked through the amazing rice fields. I would recommend this tour to everyone." },
                { author: "Christos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-11", text: "I really enjoyed the trekking tour with our guide, Nay! She helped us a lot while walking in the hills and taught us about local herbs. We also learned about the different Vietnamese ethnic groups and had an amazing experience in the bamboo forest. I even went bamboo hunting, and we also ate what we collected for dinner! Additionally, the herbal bath experience was truly fantastic. Last but not least, the foot massage with the incredible view of the Hmong homestay was the perfect relaxing ending to this one day tour." },
                { author: "Aneta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-10", text: "i had the best time on my herbal hiking tour, the route was magnificent and i learnt so much about the herbs and the village life of red dao people in general, the guide was amazing and will definitely do more with here when i’m back 10/10 recommend!!!" },
                { author: "Ruairi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "This tour was amazing! One of the best experiences I have had in Sa Pa, and in Viet Nam. The guide and hosts were incredibly welcoming, kind and knowledgeable. Although the tour seems quite long, it is suitable for people of all athletic ability, as the guide is very receptive to people’s ability and the trekking is not particularly difficult. The highlight for me was the herbal baths in the village, probably the most relaxed I’ve ever felt! Not to mention the views along the way, which were incredible." },
                { author: "Quentin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-28", text: "The hiking was great ! The herbal bath was very relaxant, I recommmend !!" },
                { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-21", text: "We had such an amazing day on this tour. Our guide was honestly the best, so kind and welcoming, and she even took us to her village where we got to eat with her family. Everyone was so warm and friendly and the food was actually really good. It felt really special! The scenery was absolutely gorgeous the whole way, nonstop views of the mountains, rice fields, and little villages. The herbal bath at the end was rustic but so relaxing, we loved it after a long day of walking. It really felt like we were getting a real look into their culture and everyday life. Would totally recommend this if yo" }
            ]
        },
