                { author: "Amber", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-11", text: "My friend and I had so much fun on the trek! Loved seeing the beautiful villages, nature and rice fields. Definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Markéta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-08", text: "The homestay is actually were more comfy than expected: bed has a heated blanquet, shower is hot and it is so quiet there, I slept like a baby. The dinner cooked at the homestay was also delicious and the ladies were sweet, answering all our strange questions about local life, they also have very good english! The trek was also nice, thru nature and local villages, rice paddies, if u have more luck than us on weather u can enjoy great views. I also liked they take care (by car) of your luggage so you dont need to repack a smaller backpack for your stay and leave the big luggage in sapa town. A" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-06", text: "Mama Mao was our tour guide, very bubbly, laughing a lot throughout the hike, very good English and Spanish for our group and always upbeat." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-07", text: "It was the most amazing 2 days, Mama Tao and her family are welcoming and their place is extremely beautiful. I would recommend this to everyone. The night was very quiet, so if you are looking for a remote and quite place this will be perfect! Excellent experience!" },
                { author: "Anais", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-14", text: "C’était une magnifique expérience, notre guide était super, elle nous parlait de l’histoire du village, nous a fait visiter les plus beaux endroits, et elle et sa famille nous ont très bien accueilli et cuisiné de délicieux plats. Je recommande à 100%." },
                { author: "Carina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-05", text: "Unsere Tour Guidin war super lustig, sehr hilfsbereit und einfach ein super Guide! Auch die Übernachtung und das Essen auf der Tour war fantastisch! Würden die Tour sofort wieder machen." }
