            reviews: [
                { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-18", text: "The landscape was beautiful and our guide Châu A Su was so nice!" },
                { author: "Molly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-20", text: "It was a lovely day! The hike was a bit tough but it was very enjoyable and the views at the top were unreal. Su was such a friendly guide, he educated us on all the different minority groups in Sapa and made our experience Top tier! Thanks again :)" },
                { author: "George", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-26", text: "It was very good. The route was a great route and our tour guide Su was very knowledgeable and friendly." },
                { author: "Steve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-19", text: "Had a great trip yesterday. Su was a brilliant guide and was very knowledgeable about the local area and traditions. It was a very wet and misty day but Su made sure the trek was still enjoyable. Was very interesting visiting local villages and learning about the local culture. Would definitely recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-27", text: "This was a great day trip! Hiking through Sa Pa was so much fun Sue was such a great guide and provided so much information and made the day so much fun, Highly recommend, it was great value for money!" },
                { author: "Cornelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-10", text: "The trekking was nice, but not very impressive because in April there is no rice on the fields. Overall nice experience, lots of steps 👌🏻" },
                { author: "Lorane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-02", text: "The hike itself was perfect (a little tricky and steep in some areas) and our guide for the day was wonderful teaching us loads about Vietnam and their culture in the villages around Sapa. He also handled an emergency (twisted ankle) with professionalism. Lunch was good too. However, the overall organization (logistics before the hike) was quite chaotic with a waiting time of more than 30min at the beginning at a random point to not communicating our dietary restrictions." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-10-11", text: "no la pude realizar, espere mas de 1 hora en el punto de encuentro, en la primera media hora nadie me atendia el tefefono ni las llamadas, luego me atendieron y me dejeron que estan por pasar a buscarme pero nunca llegaron. A las 8:20 estuve en el lugar de encuentro, 9:30 me fui corriendo en busca de otro tour ya que era mi último dia en sa pa, realmente una pena, una perdida de tiempo para mi y un mal momento. Solo espero que me devuelvan la plata y que sean atentos con los proximos clientes" },
                { author: "Amelie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-16", text: "Es war ein sehr cooler Ausflug durch die Reisfelder und Hügel von Sapa. Unsere Tour Leiterin war ausgesprochen freundlich! Lecker Essen, insgesamt sehr zufrieden!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-11", text: "Muy positivo Caminamos mucho y pudimos ver los campos de arroz y los picos más impresionantes con vistas espectaculares De 10 la experiencia" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-10", text: "lovely tour that was even nicer because of our excellent tour guide Su! We were the only two people that booked the tour today, so we had a really nice time chatting to Su and learning about the local surroundings, nature and wildlife. Thanks Su!" },
                { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-07-06", text: "Ils ne sont jamais venu au point de rdv" }
            ]
