  'moutain-valley-view-and-local-village-trek-1-day-in-sapa': {
            averageRating: 4.96,
            totalReviews: 22,
            guideRating: 4.67,
            valueRating: 4.8,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Parisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-16", text: "we had an amazing time exploring sapa with our tour guide nhu! communication before the tour was really good too, which made planning so pleasantly easy. our driver on the day was on time and friendly too. we learnt so many news things on the tour and that was thanks to nhu and her extensive knowledge! for someone looking to explore the valleys and the villages in them, this tour is well organised and no brainier" },
                { author: "Kamini", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-12", text: "This is a great an authentic experience. Our guide was excellent and each local person we met was friendly. If you’re looking for a quiet and enjoy real mountain trekking, then this is for you. You must be physically fit (medium level at least) since we go up, quite high to have the best views of Sa Pa and rice fields." },
                { author: "Catharina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-15", text: "Was a nice hike! The beginning was a little rough to get up the mountain on really steep path, but once you are on the top you have an amazing view. Our guide was very nice and spoke very good English! You will meet a lot of animals on the way ;)" },
                { author: "Lina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-22", text: "This Tour was quite challeging pysically. But it was so worth the effort. The views were stunning and also we had the greatest guide. I would highly recommand this Tour. The organisation was great, even though we only booked the day before they went out of their way to plan everything for us. Dont book this tour if you are totally unfit or have knee issues. But if you like the mountains and are also interessted in the SaPa culture: Go ahaead!" },
                { author: "Annika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-03", text: "Beautiful hike up a mountain with valley views. Delicious lunch with vegetarian/vegan options. Our guide was very knowledgeable and told is a lot about the Hmong people and their customs. Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Diana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-27", text: "we had the trekking tour with a local Nhuand was great. No one tried to sell us something. A lot of information has been provided. Recommend this tour for everyone who wants to do trekking in the forest or rice fields." },
                { author: "Joe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-27", text: "Excellent trek. Require some level of fitness though as some parts of the climb and descent are steep. The trek took about 6 to 7 hours and was peaceful with no one trying to sell their items to you. Beautiful views. The lunch was tasty too. Overall, this is a highly recommended trip." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "Everything perfect very beautiful tour" },
                { author: "Céline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-30", text: "Nous avons adoré notre guide Zaa. Elle a été à notre écoute du début à la fin. Le tour privé que nous avions choisi a été modifié à notre demande car mon conjoint et moi avions le rhum au moment du départ et les modifications apportées à notre excursion nous ont permis de profiter de la belle journée. Merci Zaa." },
                { author: "Franck", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-30", text: "Une guide incroyable (Nay) qui nous a fait découvrir des endroits magnifiques. Loin, très loin des sentiers touristiques. Une expérience incroyable et des paysages à couper le souffle !" },
                { author: "Susanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-02-10", text: "Wir haben nicht das gemacht, was in der Beschreibung stand oder nur teilweise. Der Guide war nett, hat viel Interessantes erzählt. Die Tour endete viel früher als angegeben, vielleicht wegen TET." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-10", text: "Vu was a great guide, very kind and helpful. She told us a lot about the flora and fauna of sapa and her life here. Eventhough the weather was bad, we had a good time. Would recommend." }
            ]
        },
