                { author: "Katrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Great tour around the city with lots of interesting things to be told about Ho Chi Minh." },
                { author: "Gavin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-24", text: "Much cheaper booking through GYG than paying at the ticket office. It was 30,000 vnd onsite. Your was a fantastic way to see Ho Chi" },
                { author: "Vu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "Great activity for exploring the city with out all the walking" },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-18", text: "saw the city. clean..on time easy to find..good welcome to see where sights are located & learn the history" },
                { author: "Marcia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-02", text: "I would have liked clearer instructions because the listing says no hopping on and off and yet about five couples did exactly that." },
                { author: "Fiona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-12", text: "Worthwhile, as able to see the main tourist sites in a short time and can spend longer at places that one is interested in. Air-conditioned in lower level of bus." },
                { author: "Tabassum", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-07-13", text: "It was too good We enjoyed very much It’s helpful for us to know that place better" },
                { author: "Edgardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-10", text: "Great trip. Our guide Allen made an excellent job. Book with him if you can." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-02-27", text: "I enjoy Hop On Hop Off tours in cities that I visit and these tours are available. It is a great way to see the city above the crowd." },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-10-27", text: "As many have said on other reviews, the audio quality is terrible. My port wasn't working terribly well so the audio prompts only worked a few times compared to my friend sitting next to me. The staff however were very friendly and for just over £5, it's a great way to get your bearings of Ho Chi Minh City. I'd recommend as one of the first activities you do." },
                { author: "Jo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-05-03", text: "It was indicated an audio guide would be provided on the bus and it was not. It would have been nice to know the points of interest we were driving past." }
