                { author: "Timothy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Great tour. Kai was very knowledgeable and took his time to explain each part of the tour. The pacing was perfect for a family." },
                { author: "Alicia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Thanh was a lovely, funny and very knowledgeable guide! We loved this tour" },
                { author: "Rachael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Thanh was an excellent guide and made our trip to the Cu Chi Tunnels very informative and fun. We loved the boat ride. Very happy thank you Thanh!" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Tan was very helpful and easy to understand. Good knowledge of Vietnam history and nothing was too much trouble. Would recommend this tour to everyone." },
                { author: "Joe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "We had a great trip to Cu Chi Tunnels guided by Tim. He was very knowledgeable and a great guide. Finished with a nice meal too. Would highly recommend" },
                { author: "Jenna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "The trip was great! Our guide was excellent and it was fantastic to arrive by boat rather than having to deal with the Saigon traffic. Thoroughly recommend." },
                { author: "Suzanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Due to unforeseen circumstances we weren’t able to go to the tunnels on the speedboat due to the river being closed off to tourist boats. We were advised of this the night before and Kim travel re-arranged our transportation professionally and with so much kindness. We were picked up in a private vehicle by our driver and guide Nhu. Nhu was very knowledgeable and was a great companion to have during the day. The driver was friendly and showed so much patience especially setting the scene for a relaxing drive both there and back. Nhu is the sweetest lady who took excellent care of us throughout" },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "A ver interesting and informative day with Tranh. The tunnels and artillery sound was confronting, and Tranh was able to explain and answer questions really well. It was wonderful to travel via boat and see the changing river scenery. Highly recommended" },
                { author: "Jake", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "This tour was brilliant and Ten was a fantastic guide. Personable, knowledgeable and great humour. His recount of his father in the war was a great touch to the tour. Thanks again Ten!" },
                { author: "Jeremy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "It was a great trip, Thanh was a great tour guide and guided us well thru the tunnels area and provided first hand information that is truly unique to the history of the area. The boat road was a great way to enjoy the views and get to the tunnels, would recommend." },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Really enjoyed the day trip. Thanh was very informative and helpful" },
                { author: "Aadi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Kai was super helpful and informative - couldn’t have asked for a better guide! :) Speed boat was super fun and was super interesting learning about the tunnels and the guerrilla efforts." }
