            valueRating: 4.94,
            reviews: [
                { author: "katy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Albert , Zoey and John were the most wonderful guides. We had just a brilliant night exploring many different foods, drinks , districts and drinks all on the back of a motorbike. The different foods were really amazing , delicious and plentiful .. we were stuffed when we finished !!! Cannot recommend this tour enough" },
                { author: "DeArna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Our guides Thuy and Tommy for our private tour were absolutely wonderful from start to finish, they greeted us warmly and asked us questions to break the ice. The food tour itself was incredible. The food was tasty and Thuy was extremely informative about all that we were eating, from showing us what different herbs were to telling us when the locals actually ate certain types of food. Both guides were accommodating and thoughtful going above and beyond what either me and my partner were expecting. By the end of the evning they did not feel like your typical tour guides but rather friends who" },
                { author: "Todd", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "Our tour was fantastic. Thuy (Twee) was our lead guide and she was wonderfully kind, friendly and knowledgeable. We loved the variety of foods at five different stops. The food was exactly why I had hoped that it would be, great tasting and endless. Great tour, great experience." },
                { author: "Kylie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "we had thr best time exploring HCMC with Catherine and Joyce and the delicious food the city has to offer. absolutely loved that the tour was private. gave us time to learn so much more. we would never had ventured as far without them. such and enjoyable evening. no only the food and their knowledge but also thier company. we had a lot of fun and lots of laughs" },
                { author: "Marco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "We had a fantastic time with Albert Sandy Zoey and Storm. They treated us to delicious traditional dishes and even took us on a motorbike tour around the city which really enhanced the experience. We thoroughly enjoyed the tour and highly recommend it. Thanks to the team!" },
                { author: "Kelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "We had the absolute best time on our motorbike food tour with Thuy, Clara, John and Tim! Pick up at our hotel was very smooth and we were off into the crazy Saigon traffic. Our tour guides were also the best drivers navigating through the evening! We stopped at 6 places and enjoyed 10 different foods, unique to Vietnam. The food was amazing. We got to experience local places we likely wouldn’t have found on our own, and even Michelin star street food! Not only was the food good but our tour guides were knowledgeable about the food we were eating and about the city and various sites we stopped" },
                { author: "Anne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "My friends and I had a wonderful time on this tour. We've been exploring the food in Ho Chi Minh for a couple days but wouldn't have found the spots the guides took us to. They took us to great spots and even shared the history for some. We didn't just enjoy the food, we also learned a bit about history and culture. The guides were very friendly, had wonderful energy, and we truly enjoyed our time." },
                { author: "Emmalene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "Tran and tuoi were great, very accomodating to my sleepy boyfriend who needed special assistance. The whole experience is a must learning about so much more then food and great way to see the city" },
                { author: "Hugh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "We had an amazing experience with Quinton and Chloe as our guides. They were incredible from start to finish. Delicious food options with lots of variety as well as providing great knowledge about the history of the cuisine and local areas. Could not recommend them both enough. Would absolutely suggest this to anyone coming to Ho Chi Ming" },
                { author: "Cornelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "Tour was very nice. Thuy, Tuoi and Storm worked very good togheter. We tasted wonderful food and they knew a lot about life in vietnam and food. We walked also around and could see flower market and old buildings." },
                { author: "charles", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-12", text: "The tour was great, Catherine and Crystal were perfect guides. We felt safe the entire time we were riding on their bikes and they took care of everything perfectly and gave us tons of good information about Saigon and Vietnam. Would 100% recommend." },
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "What an incredible night! This Ho Chi Minh City food tour by motorbike exceeded all expectations. Our guides, Aaron and Crystal, were fantastic — knowledgeable, friendly, and clearly passionate about sharing their city’s food culture. We zipped through the city at night on the back of motorbikes, which was such a fun and exhilarating way to see Ho Chi Minh City lit up after dark. We tried 9 different dishes at famous local food stalls, with unlimited drinks along the way, and every dish was delicious. Aaron and Crystal took us down hidden alleys we never would have found on our own, giving us" }
            ]
