  'can-gio-mangrove-forest-day-tour-in-ho-chi-minh-city': {
            averageRating: 4.81,
            totalReviews: 95,
            guideRating: 4.66,
            valueRating: 4.41,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Simona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "Excellent trip, private car with a chauffeur and a guide who were both very kind. The guide was knowledgeable so he shared a lot of facts about Vietnam that were beyond the tour itself." },
                { author: "Vikki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "This was a wonderful experience led by Leo, History, unusual animals, authentic lunch, very safe and professional driving, clearly one of the highlights of our trip to Vietnam!" },
                { author: "Gretta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "We really enjoyed our trip with our guide Tom. The car was comfortable and the guides comments were interesting and full. We have visited monkey Islands monkey Park gorilla squad museum crocodile farm Manorwood sanctuary and saw there some bats. Where is crocodile fishing? Was which was really far and I’m motorboat and canoe. Very joyful trip and very professionally done." },
                { author: "Anja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-13", text: "Amazing tour away from the busy Saigon to the quiet and less touristy nature. It was a great tip and we enjoyed visiting the mangrove forest by foot and boat. Seeing the monkeys and bats was wonderful, Harry was a great and super friendly guide who also took nice pictures for us and the food was amazing too. Thank you for a great day!" },
                { author: "Dominik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-28", text: "Beautiful day With our amazing guide Jacky Hieu. We was beautiful and handsome. We would recommend this tour. And again ask for Jacky. ✌️" },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-09", text: "It was a wonderful tour! Jacky Hieu is a wonderful guide, very charismatic, knowledgeable, and a friend to everyone! He will find you the best prices and offers the most of your experience, all while having a blast! I couldn’t recommend Jacky enough and I hope you look for him in the future." },
                { author: "holly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-15", text: "Today our guide Jacky hieu took us into the mangrove forest, monkey island, bat lagoon. It was an amazing day. First Jacky arranged for the ranger to call a troop of monkeys down for photos and feeding. Then we went to the look out tower. The we took a boat down the river to a paddle boat to find the bats. We did not see them at our first stop so our guide took us to another spot. Here it started to rain and Jacky gave us ponchos. Then we went by tuk tuk to crocodile fishing. Jacky spent lots of time taking great photos for us. We had an amazing experience and we recommend you ask for Jacky Hi" },
                { author: "Tania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-27", text: "Excellent from bookings online, and with Jackie Hiew contacting us before and making us have extraordinary experience and day with him, and his very excellent driver:) Thank you both for a wonderful experience and day out in the fresh air, and nature. The organization and planning of the day was excellent from start to finish to finish- Thank you:)" },
                { author: "Evangelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-11", text: "We had an amazing day! The whole tour was beautiful !!! Also our guide was top notch ! He organised everything super well and was very communicative even before the tour! He didn’t only make our day in mangrove forest amazing but also helped us with everything else we wanted to plan during our stay in Vietnam ! We also booked his tour for the Chu Chi Tunnels that was also a must ! Thank you To 🫶🏾" },
                { author: "Aleksandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-03", text: "It was a very nice trip. The mangrove forest is gorgeous. We also seen a lot of mokneys and crocodiles. I really recommend this trip :)" },
                { author: "Marc", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-16", text: "We had a sunny and andventures day with a very friendly and helpful guide. We really can recommend Jacky Hieu. He makes lots of pictures and videos of you ;-) The tour is expensive but worth it, when you dont want to wait for others and have some privat time. The food is also good." },
                { author: "Philip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-30", text: "Spent a wonderful day exploring all that is wonderful about Vietnam, all with the expert guidance and wonderful wit and humour of our guide Jackie Hieu, he is without doubt a fantastic guide and a wonderful person, made our day an unforgettable experience. Make sure you ask for him on your tour." }
            ]
        },
