                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-08-09", text: "Do not book! We booked this tour to learn about the history of the Cu Chi Tunnels, but the experience was extremely disappointing and unprofessional. We left HCMC at 12:45 pm and only arrived at 3:30 pm because of commercial stops. The guide spoke very poor English and provided almost no historical background. Most explanations were just 2–3 broken sentences describing what was already visible. Questions were often not understood. When we repeatedly asked for more historical context, the Guide became visibly angry, raised his voice and even claimed that another guide was giving false informati" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-06-23", text: "The tour itself was great and the guide was wonderful, kind and insightful. But ohhhhh!!! Organizing it was sooooo stressful. They company does not pick up from the areas that they say they do... and they were hard to contact and unhelpful." }
