                { author: "Susie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-05-10", text: "Overall it went well. The location was all the way down the alleyway; not near the street. The ladies teaching me were kind and had limited English: Google translate is a must. The shop offers a few different painting type classes and seems popular with locals. I would do it again but would book directly via the shop." },
                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2026-01-04", text: "Guides had limited English, needs better explanation. Also instead of photos, real samples should be shown to get a proper idea of what project to choose. An activity list of steps involve would be helpful so one can know what comes next to progress the project. I was disappointed as the English was poor and no Google translate to help me understand the choices and outcome. I am not a good drawer so I should have been given the option to work with texture. I was unhappy with the end result of my work. I would not repeat this workshop." }
