                { author: "Gabrielle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-11", text: "Was a really fun day, with good food and lots of varieties, multiple different types of boat rides and even some biking. Our tour guide Lam was so funny and friendly and shared about interesting facs of the region and language. would recommend." },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "great guide , Nikki was interesting and fun company with very good English and all the sights and activities were really good fun" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-21", text: "Enjoyable tour providing a good taste of the Mekong Delta and local culture. Jerry was a great guide, thank you!" },
                { author: "Tarmo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-18", text: "We had excellent day. Thanks to our tour guide Hannah ! Transport to marina, trip by different boats, bikeride, lunch and activities were all very interesting. Group of 11 people we had, were great tour companions. Finished at hotel at evening tired and happy. I definetly reccomend this tour and guide Hannah Bring open mind, bottle of water and thirst for adventure, thats all you need. PS try feeding crocodiles and drink snakedrink….i am alive, so you will survive that also :) Greetings from Estonia Tarmo & Klarika" },
                { author: "john", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "Great day trip. Our guide, Dran, was brilliant. lots of variety on different boats, bike ride and local entertainment. Local produce and information very good. Vale for money. 😊" },
                { author: "Lynn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-28", text: "Minh, our guide was fantastic. He was knowledgeable, friendly and helpful. A pleasure to spend the day with. There were small children in our group and the way he included them and helped the parents was wonderful" },
                { author: "GEORGIOS", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-24", text: "An excellent trip..From our guide to the food and the scenery everything were perfect! Totally recommended!" },
                { author: "Tanya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-13", text: "a lovely relaxing day, it was very well organised and our tour guide Twin was amazing! she was very accommodating to everyone in the group, was very friendly/entertaining, and had great knowledge to give." },
                { author: "Jan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-27", text: "Had an amazing trip to the Mekong Delta with our fantastic guide, Tebi! His knowledge and passion made the journey unforgettable. From the journey by boat to serene canals, every stops during the whole trip was special. Highly recommend this tour with Tebi for an authentic and memorable experience!" },
                { author: "Pete", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-27", text: "Lots to interesting things to see and do. Really enjoyed it and Jason was a great tour lead!" }
