                { author: "Oliver", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "The tour was great. You visit all the major tourist destinations in one day. Our guide Jackie was great, we learned a lot about Vietnams history. I can recommend this tour for everyone who wants to see as much as possible in one day. You should schedule 10 to 12 hours for the tour, depending on the traffic." },
                { author: "Perrot", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Qualité du guide Jackie qui parlait un anglais lentement et de manière compréhensible pour les non anglophone aguerris 😊 Diversité des prestations qui sont complètes pour visiter Ho Chi Minh ville À recommander" },
                { author: "maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "tome el tour de full day en Ho Chi Minh, me voy cansada, pero llena de recuerdos, conocimiento y buenos momentos. Jackie nuestro guia tiene mucho conocimiento de historia y de todos los lugares donde fuimos y lo hizo de una forma en que todo parecia muy interesante. Debo agregar que soy vegetariana y Jackie hizo su mejor esfuerzo para que yo pudiera comer bien." },
                { author: "Delphine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "L’excursion était super. Nous avons eu Jacky en tant que guide, il parle super bien anglais et super clairement. C’était un vrai plaisir de l’avoir comme guide, il nous a expliqué l’histoire du Vietnam, la guerre du Vietnam ainsi que les tunnels de Cuchi. Je recommande vraiment cette excursion si vous souhaitez en apprendre sur l’histoire du Vietnam." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "Wonderful, the guide had very good English and explained so much for the context and history of the country and everything we were seeing definitely glad to have booked this tour." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-11", text: "Ett väldigt bra alternativ för att täcka det mesta av Saigons sevärdheter under en dag, med bra guidning och information från guiden Jackie. Observera, mycket tid i en van (ca 1.5-2h enkel väg) till Cu chi tunnlarna, men värt det. Skulle rekommendera att även gå på museet i Hanoi för att få båda sidorna av historien." }
