                { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-10", text: "All the activities were excellent. Dennis was wonderful, made sure to include everyone…gave history of areas and sites we were visiting. Dennis is very knowledgeable of his cultural. Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Linus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-19", text: "Our Guide Tin Tin spoke great english and was funny. We had an amzing tour and learned a lot about vietnamese culture. The food was enough and all included in the price. The pick up and drop off was smooth." },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-02", text: "worth every penny.! Thank you to our guide ‘Chow’ for going above and beyond for us the whole day." },
                { author: "Karlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-13", text: "Our guide Milo was lovely and informative. We had an amazing day kayaking, cycling, visiting a local farm, unicorn island with coconut candy making and honey tea. Lunch was delicious and my son really enjoyed the cooking class. My boys 10 & 13 had so much fun. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Tamara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-09", text: "Jam packed with activities. Kayaking and cycling were definite highlights! Chow was so nice and friendly (although he still owes me a coconut). Vegan option for the cooking class was very good. Would’ve enjoyed more time kayaking and cycling. Saw so much Vietnamese culture that would’ve missed." },
                { author: "Mathilde", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-15", text: "The activity itself was great and the places we visited were really worth it. However, the guide seemed a bit uninterested. During the kayak part he went quite far ahead of the group so nobody knew where to go, and on the way back he even lost part of the group while walking to the van." },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "We hebben een privé tour geboekt en deze was echt fantastisch. Het had alles in zich: fietsen, kajakken, twee boottochten, mini kookworkshop met heerlijk eten én een geweldige gids! Tin Tin kon heel goed Engels, wist veel en was leuk en grappig. We hebben genoten!" },
                { author: "Takizawa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-23", text: "ツアーガイドのDenissさんがとても素晴らしかったです 目的地に行く間に、ベトナムの日常について説明や各種ツアー中も色々な体験をさせてくれました とても良い体験でした 特に大きな蛇を首に巻ける体験はすごかったです 蛇は大人しくとてもかわいいです" },
                { author: "Susanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "Es war eine tolle Tour? Unser Guide Dennis war sehr aufmerksam und hat alles möglich gemacht. Vielen Dank für den schönen Tag!" },
                { author: "Juliette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-09", text: "Très belle excursion, des places magnifiques, une balade à vélo et en kayak tout en simplicité j’ai beaucoup aimé" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-04-25", text: "Activité plus touristique que prévue. Le kayak était super, malheureusement nous n'avons pas pu faire de la bicyclette car le guide était très stress ce jour-là. Effectivement quelques routes se fermaient au centre ville pour une manifestation et il voulait rentrer avant. Tout était minuté. Dommage... mais peut-être que tout aurait été différent un autre jour." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-22", text: "We had an excellent day with our guide Jack. Jack was very good teaching us and passing on information and instructions. Our lunch was yummy and the transport was nice with good aircon. For a full day tour we couldn’t have asked for more. We would definitely recommend this tour." }
