                { author: "Alan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Wonderful tour Our tour guide Tony was just amazing.. Punctual, friendly, polite and very very knowledgeable 🙏 Would 100% recommend 👍" },
                { author: "Kerry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "We have been in Vietnam for a week now and we cannot speak highly enough of our tour guide, Wombat. The knowledge of the Long Tan & Nui Dat Battle fields was endless. As soon as the tour started he makes you feel part of the family. The whole trip was extremely great and a time never to forget. We would like to thank Binh(Wombat) for a trip well worth while and memories not forgotten. David and Kerry👍" },
                { author: "Jemimah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-09-15", text: "We enjoyed seeing the sights on this tour, and our tour guide Uncle Nam was very funny! It wasn’t quite as in-depth as we were expecting, and found we were having to do our own research at each location to learn more. We paid for the 8-hr tour however were picked up at 8am and dropped off again about 6-hrs later, and were told half way through the tour that we would have to pay more to continue for longer? Overall still a good experience and we saw fascinating places, but it didn’t quite match what was advertised." }
