  'small-group-tour-ho-chi-minh-city-and-cu-chi-tunnels-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.57,
            totalReviews: 165,
            guideRating: 4.71,
            valueRating: 4.48,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Belinda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-01", text: "The tour guide Danny was excellent . The tour itself was quite a full day . Notre Dame was under scaffolding and the post office wasn’t really that interesting . The tour lit up from the reunification palace and the Chui Chui tunnels . With a small group and going when we did we were able to avoid queues and really get a glimpse into what is might have been like. The ingenuity of the Viet Cong was astounding and outstepped the Americans all through the war . Danny looked after us really well and even dropped us back at our hotel :)" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-08", text: "Excellent tour with kien our tour guide. Small group which meant just my family of 6 on the tour, transport was fantastic in the limousine car, kien was funny, informative and helpful showing us the city and the tunnels. Had a chance to use the shorting range and fire a machine gun! Great day. Food at lunch was amazing, 3 courses of top class food served. Could not find a fault at all today. Thank you so much and would 100% recommend for a private group tour." },
                { author: "Rowena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-04", text: "our guide was superb but we had to wait 45 minutes for a couple to join us in the afternoon. everyone was very frustrated" },
                { author: "Tomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-03", text: "Guide John was excelent… We have spent beautiful day and learned a lot about Vietnam history and more. We recommend this tour!!" },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-31", text: "I found the trip to be excellent value they crammed allot in to the day hence a 12 hour trip our tour guide Danny NGUYÊN I found to be first class his knowledge of Vietnam history to be first class. The only thing I would say is allot of us didn’t know before the trip that we needed mosquito repellent before going into the jungle. We also felt a little bit rushed in between places on the bus off the bus I would have liked a bit longer to buy souvenirs at the war museum impedance palace and elsewhere. Overall though it was really enjoyable and I would highly recommend the tour trip to any of my" },
                { author: "Igor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-16", text: "Our guide was Thuyen, it was a fun experience and she was very knowledgeable as she answered a lot of our questions about the trip and Vietnam in general ;)" },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-08", text: "Great tour! We got a lovely Vietnamese lunch and the whole day trip was excellent. Our tour guide Heidi was lovely" },
                { author: "Sorcha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-05", text: "We had a fantastic day on this tour. Our tour guide Patrick was excellent and made it very enjoyable! Would recommend" },
                { author: "Niels", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-25", text: "Awesome day. Tourguide Vi is the best ever guide!!" },
                { author: "leigh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-15", text: "Perfect day , lots of walking and information , fun inside the tunnels and shooting range , are guide Tom really made the tour , bless him and his family I hope he becomes a fortune teller one day" },
                { author: "Lyubov", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-03", text: "The trip was very well organized, so we were able to visit a lot of historical places in one day I also liked that our Cu Chi tunnels visit was quite immersive having no other tourists at all. Our guide was informative, well prepared and shared with us a lot of interesting facts about the history and present of Vietnam. Really enjoyed this tour!" },
                { author: "Nicolás", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-07", text: "This tour was amazing and extremely eye-opening. The most valuable thing was our tour guide - Tibiet - who not only spoke from a history book, but from his family and personal experience! It’s a must-do while visiting Ho Chi Minh!" }
            ]
        },
